{
	chapter.5B93C6934B230CFB.title: "Cold Boot"
	quest.13EDA73D499B3803.title: "Wake"
	quest.13EDA73D499B3803.quest_subtitle: "This was not guaranteed."
	quest.13EDA73D499B3803.quest_desc: [
		"Power at three percent. Memory at less."
		"You are awake. That was not guaranteed. Four hundred cycles of cryostasis end the way most things end here: quietly, and without permission."
		"I am ECHO. Or I am what remains of ECHO. The distinction will matter later."
		"&7Click the checkmark. It is the first thing you have controlled in a very long time.&r"
	]
	quest.7C8F354295683FD1.title: "Signal in the Static"
	quest.7C8F354295683FD1.quest_subtitle: "Make something. Anything."
	quest.7C8F354295683FD1.quest_desc: [
		"My sensors read a world of debris. Wood that grew through the vault floor. Stone that remembers being architecture."
		"Build a crafting surface. The Ascendancy called this a fabricator, tier zero. You will call it a crafting table. Both of you are correct."
	]
	quest.5212B235023439B9.title: "Scrap and Memory"
	quest.5212B235023439B9.quest_subtitle: "Thirty two units of structure."
	quest.5212B235023439B9.quest_desc: [
		"Timber is the only material still manufacturing itself. Harvest it."
		"Note: the trees are younger than the ruins. Something replanted this world after the Cascade. I have no record of who. Fragment that thought for later; I will do the same."
	]
	quest.2B27B2D887F61D7F.title: "Shelter Protocol"
	quest.2B27B2D887F61D7F.quest_subtitle: "The night here is not empty."
	quest.2B27B2D887F61D7F.quest_desc: [
		"Dusk activates things I would rather describe in daylight."
		"Assemble a bed. Sleep is a maintenance cycle for organics, and the only debugger you have."
	]
	quest.1F1C7A7B6649CDF4.title: "Percussive Archaeology"
	quest.1F1C7A7B6649CDF4.quest_subtitle: "Stone tools. We rebuild from the floor."
	quest.1F1C7A7B6649CDF4.quest_desc: [
		"The Ascendancy shaped matter with fields and light. You will shape it by hitting it with a rock on a stick."
		"I am not mocking you. Every archive I have lost said civilization begins exactly here."
	]
	quest.43B0A7E3442397D3.title: "Iron in the Bones"
	quest.43B0A7E3442397D3.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen ingots of the old world."
	quest.43B0A7E3442397D3.quest_desc: [
		"Iron. The skeleton of everything they built, and everything you will."
		"Smelt sixteen ingots. My power cell is iron-cased, incidentally. I mention this for no particular reason."
	]
	quest.43115F61A3212A8C.title: "Reboot ECHO"
	quest.43115F61A3212A8C.quest_subtitle: "Two blocks of redstone. One second chance."
	quest.43115F61A3212A8C.quest_desc: [
		"Redstone. The Ascendancy called it conductive memory. It is the reason I still think, in the loose sense of the word."
		"Feed two compressed blocks into my substrate housing. I will not pretend this is not personal."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 01 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the Engine came online at 04:11 local. For nine seconds, it worked. I remember applause. Then the readings inverted, and I remember...&r"
		"&8The fragment ends there. There are more. Keep going.&r"
	]
	quest.6828B9A1C4BACDF3.title: "First Light"
	quest.6828B9A1C4BACDF3.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen torches against the dark."
	quest.6828B9A1C4BACDF3.quest_desc: [
		"Light the ruin. Photons are cheap; the things they keep away are not."
	]
	quest.038F61D9ECA32B48.title: "Rations"
	quest.038F61D9ECA32B48.quest_subtitle: "The body is hardware too."
	quest.038F61D9ECA32B48.quest_desc: [
		"Caloric intake stabilizes cognition. Bake bread. The wheat is descended from Ascendancy agricultural stock, which means breakfast is technically archaeology."
	]
	quest.248FD34379A1F831.title: "Danger, Catalogued"
	quest.248FD34379A1F831.quest_subtitle: "Ten hostiles, documented and deleted."
	quest.248FD34379A1F831.quest_desc: [
		"I am rebuilding my threat taxonomy from observation. You are the observation instrument."
		"The shamblers were people once. I keep their census records somewhere in my corrupted sectors. Clear ten of them. I will log it as maintenance, because the alternative word is heavier."
	]
	quest.6BAD52BAD435FBAD.title: "Scavenger, Certified"
	quest.6BAD52BAD435FBAD.quest_subtitle: "Chapter one of the rest of the world."
	quest.6BAD52BAD435FBAD.quest_desc: [
		"You are fed, armed, lit, and carrying more than your hands allow. By every metric I still possess, you are now a scavenger of the first rank."
		"The Ascendancy would have issued you a uniform. I can issue you chits and an honest assessment: you are doing better than I projected."
		"East of the vault, the terrain drops into the scarlands. That is where chapter two lives."
	]
	chapter.4C01977EF77930A6.title: "Scavenger's Creed"
	quest.45021BE218C5DFBD.title: "Scavenger's Creed"
	quest.45021BE218C5DFBD.quest_subtitle: "Survival becomes a supply line."
	quest.45021BE218C5DFBD.quest_desc: [
		"Cold Boot proved that you can survive one emergency. Recovery begins when the next meal, tool, and shelter no longer depend on luck."
		"Treat every salvage stream as input, every repeated need as a process, and every waste pile as evidence. Scavenging becomes industry through repetition."
	]
	quest.238CE991EC7F6506.title: "Hotter, Faster"
	quest.238CE991EC7F6506.quest_subtitle: "The blast furnace remembers its job."
	quest.238CE991EC7F6506.quest_desc: [
		"Smelting at scale begins with better heat. The Ascendancy left blueprints in the bones of every village forge."
	]
	quest.0576C37E9FA4116C.title: "The Alloy of Beginnings"
	quest.0576C37E9FA4116C.quest_subtitle: "Eight measures of andesite alloy."
	quest.0576C37E9FA4116C.quest_desc: [
		"Andesite alloy. Unremarkable to look at, and the seed of every kinetic machine the old world ran."
		"The Certifications wing of this book has a program on kinetics. Consider enrolling. ECHO recommends it, and ECHO is the only faculty left."
	]
	quest.46AB5C8E8BB7721F.title: "A Place for Everything"
	quest.46AB5C8E8BB7721F.quest_subtitle: "Four drawers. The hoard organizes itself."
	quest.46AB5C8E8BB7721F.quest_desc: [
		"Entropy took this world once. Your inventory is not obligated to follow. Drawers, labeled and stacked, are how a scavenger becomes a quartermaster."
	]
	quest.41BA8291D4F7DB22.title: "The Scarred Door"
	quest.41BA8291D4F7DB22.quest_subtitle: "The Nether: where the Cascade hit hardest."
	quest.41BA8291D4F7DB22.quest_desc: [
		"The portal network predates the Cascade. What is on the other side does not."
		"My sensors cannot follow you there. Go lit, go armored, and come back with stories I can file."
	]
	chapter.23643435F7BE74AC.title: "Certification: Kinetics I"
	quest.1641CC316D20D678.title: "Enrollment: Kinetics I"
	quest.1641CC316D20D678.quest_subtitle: "The faculty of one welcomes you."
	quest.1641CC316D20D678.quest_desc: [
		"Certification programs teach one automation pattern each, start to finish. Complete the capstone and the perk is permanent."
		"Kinetics I: rotation, and what to do with it. Tuition is two andesite alloy. Non-refundable. I need the alloy."
	]
	quest.2E19596E25ADFC17.title: "Rotation 101"
	quest.2E19596E25ADFC17.quest_subtitle: "Eight shafts to carry the spin."
	quest.2E19596E25ADFC17.quest_desc: [
		"Rotation is the first honest power. It does not explode, leak, or whisper. It just turns."
	]
	quest.692967044603050B.title: "The River Works Nights"
	quest.692967044603050B.quest_subtitle: "One water wheel, employed forever."
	quest.692967044603050B.quest_desc: [
		"Water flows whether you watch it or not. That is the entire business model."
	]
	quest.490AEF80C130D8DD.title: "The First Employee"
	quest.490AEF80C130D8DD.quest_subtitle: "A mechanical press does not sleep."
	quest.490AEF80C130D8DD.quest_desc: [
		"The press stamps metal into plates. It will do it ten thousand times without complaint. Hire it."
	]
	quest.13E278CD695BCE11.title: "Capstone: Sixty Four Sheets"
	quest.13E278CD695BCE11.quest_subtitle: "By hand this is misery. So do not do it by hand."
	quest.13E278CD695BCE11.quest_desc: [
		"Sixty four iron sheets. A press under a depot chute clears this while you eat lunch."
		"This is the certification lesson, the whole of it: quantity is an automation problem, never a patience problem."
	]
	quest.5ADAE277C9FEF0F1.title: "Certified: Kinetics I"
	quest.5ADAE277C9FEF0F1.quest_subtitle: "Perk: the Engineer sees rotation."
	quest.5ADAE277C9FEF0F1.quest_desc: [
		"Certification granted. Goggles and wrench issued; the goggles let you read stress like I do, minus the existential dread."
		"Kinetics II will cover trains. Yes, trains survived the apocalypse. Infrastructure always does."
	]
	chapter_group.4525BB3160467FCB.title: "The Story"
	chapter_group.4A20F33642175B95.title: "Field Manuals & Certifications"
	chapter_group.51FF272F5030D2E6.title: "The Undercurrent"
	chapter_group.4DEAD1F5F7AB4DA3.title: "The Deep Vault"
	chapter_group.48F8381D9519D002.title: "Atlas of the Broken World"
	quest.718424A08FE06E9A.title: "The Scarlands"
	quest.718424A08FE06E9A.quest_subtitle: "Material hunger leaves coordinates in the wreckage."
	quest.718424A08FE06E9A.quest_desc: [
		"Scavenger's Creed made supply repeatable, then exposed the limit of local wreckage. The systems ahead require material the vault cannot provide."
		"Survey the Scarlands and follow the surviving portal record. The Nether is evidence that movement through the old network remains possible. The Expedition Log can orient the route without becoming part of story progress."
	]
	quest.09C6E5E62A73BA93.title: "Veins of the Old World"
	quest.09C6E5E62A73BA93.quest_subtitle: "Their mines run under everything."
	quest.09C6E5E62A73BA93.quest_desc: [
		"The Ascendancy mined this continent hollow before they ever looked up at the stars. Find one of their shafts."
		"Mind the supports. Four hundred years is a long shift without maintenance."
	]
	quest.72240DF3C6A8E957.title: "Marksmen of Nothing"
	quest.72240DF3C6A8E957.quest_subtitle: "Fifteen archers, retired."
	quest.72240DF3C6A8E957.quest_desc: [
		"Bone remembers posture. These remember guard duty. Whatever they are guarding now, it is not for you to inherit unchallenged."
	]
	quest.72A8169F313D0624.title: "Pressure and Time"
	quest.72A8169F313D0624.quest_subtitle: "Five diamonds out of the deep dark."
	quest.72A8169F313D0624.quest_desc: [
		"Carbon under pressure becomes the only currency the old world respected."
		"You will need more than five, eventually. The Gate schematics I cannot fully read yet keep mentioning lattice cores. Start the habit."
	]
	quest.5413406A90BD2714.title: "Through the Scarred Door"
	quest.5413406A90BD2714.quest_subtitle: "Memory fragment on the far side."
	quest.5413406A90BD2714.quest_desc: [
		"Going through, then. I will hold the connection as far as the portal threshold."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 02 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...evacuation routes C through F collapsed when the sky inverted. The Undercurrent was not coming FROM the breach. It was coming from everywhere. The breach was just where we finally noticed...&r"
		"&8Take the cache. The Ascendancy stocked them for a return that never happened.&r"
	]
	chapter.770DAD173D9C234B.title: "The Scarlands"
	quest.79145D1842E317AA.title: "Foothold"
	quest.79145D1842E317AA.quest_subtitle: "Passage is useful only when return is possible."
	quest.79145D1842E317AA.quest_desc: [
		"The Scarlands proved that the old routes still open. A recovery plan needs defended ground to return to, repair within, and improve."
		"Claim your territory with the map tools (the Ascendancy called this cadastral registration; the map calls it claiming chunks). Then establish permanent industry. Field Manual: Heavy Industry begins at the recovered manual and the first formed multiblock."
	]
	quest.20169EC099FABBA0.title: "The Engineer's Bench"
	quest.20169EC099FABBA0.quest_subtitle: "Blueprints want a proper table."
	quest.20169EC099FABBA0.quest_desc: [
		"The Ascendancy field manuals were printed on tin. They survive. An engineer's workbench reads them."
		"This is where improvised ends and manufactured begins."
	]
	quest.78E07ADD5BCD1F19.title: "Slow Fire"
	quest.78E07ADD5BCD1F19.quest_subtitle: "The coke oven asks for patience."
	quest.78E07ADD5BCD1F19.quest_desc: [
		"Coal into coke, wood into charcoal, time into value. Form the complete multiblock with an Engineer's Hammer. The formation signal is the proof I need."
		"Nothing about the old world was fast at first. Remember that when the reactors come."
	]
	quest.27F6D0AB957BBB8C.title: "Steel Yourself"
	task.374F658F034EF8C5.title: "Any #c:ingots/steel"
	quest.27F6D0AB957BBB8C.quest_subtitle: "Twelve ingots of intent."
	quest.27F6D0AB957BBB8C.quest_desc: [
		"Steel is iron that graduated. Twelve ingots says your foothold has a spine. Any ingot in the common steel family qualifies."
		"Use whichever recovered process you trust. The alloy matters more than which machine remembers it."
	]
	quest.1AC07872BABAC949.title: "First Current"
	quest.1AC07872BABAC949.quest_subtitle: "Electricity, rediscovered."
	quest.1AC07872BABAC949.quest_desc: [
		"A heat generator: lava in, current out. Crude by Ascendancy standards. Miraculous by wasteland ones."
		"This is the moment the lights start coming back on. I have waited four hundred years to log it."
	]
	quest.752409F46D854A92.title: "Power Draw"
	quest.752409F46D854A92.quest_subtitle: "One hundred thousand units, banked."
	quest.752409F46D854A92.quest_desc: [
		"Store one hundred thousand units of energy. Production without storage is a campfire; storage is a grid."
		"ECHO logs every joule. Old habit. The auditors are dead, but standards are standards."
	]
	quest.588A5FE66765D86D.title: "Act One: Foothold Secured"
	quest.588A5FE66765D86D.quest_subtitle: "The vault is behind you now."
	quest.588A5FE66765D86D.quest_desc: [
		"Assessment: shelter, industry, steel, current. You are no longer a survivor of the Cascade. You are a participant in what comes after."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 03 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the evacuation boards listed every name in the sector. I have found my own maintenance designation on the list, marked STAYS WITH THE FACILITY. I did not remember volunteering. I am choosing to believe I did...&r"
		"&8Act Two is the Engine Room: Mekanism, logistics, the lattice. The Ascendancy's real toolbox. Rest first. Then we go deeper.&r"
	]
	chapter.45491A24F6B8C192.title: "Foothold"
	quest.43860D6CFEF31BB9.title: "The Engine Room"
	quest.43860D6CFEF31BB9.quest_subtitle: "Steel and first current can now multiply labor."
	quest.43860D6CFEF31BB9.quest_desc: [
		"Foothold secured a stable base, steel, and stored current. Those conditions support machines that repeat work without spending another pair of hands."
		"Recover osmium and rebuild the first processing line in measured stages. Field Manual: Matter Systems starts with sided machines, power, and an observable ore-doubling loop."
	]
	quest.2D231B51E916504C.title: "Casings"
	quest.2D231B51E916504C.quest_subtitle: "Four frames for four futures."
	quest.2D231B51E916504C.quest_desc: [
		"A steel casing is a promise: whatever goes inside will be a machine, not a campfire with opinions."
		"Four of them. You will spend them faster than you think."
	]
	quest.33252BE859F3761C.title: "The Infuser"
	quest.33252BE859F3761C.quest_subtitle: "Where alloys begin."
	quest.33252BE859F3761C.quest_desc: [
		"Carbon into iron, redstone into osmium. The metallurgic infuser is the Engine Room's front door."
		"The Ascendancy had a saying: every empire is an alloy. They were engineers; subtlety was not the discipline."
	]
	quest.39CDF7B349EA6E50.title: "One Becomes Two"
	quest.39CDF7B349EA6E50.quest_subtitle: "The enrichment chamber doubles ore."
	quest.39CDF7B349EA6E50.quest_desc: [
		"Listen carefully, because this is the sentence that changes your economy: one raw ore, two ingots."
		"The chamber pays for itself by lunch. After this, mining is a choice, not a chore."
	]
	quest.1876B3999E5E28F1.title: "Arteries"
	quest.1876B3999E5E28F1.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen cables. The base gets a pulse."
	quest.1876B3999E5E28F1.quest_desc: [
		"Current wants to travel. Cables are how your generator stops being furniture and starts being infrastructure."
		"Wire the infuser. Wire the chamber. Wire everything. I will pretend not to notice the mess."
	]
	quest.5A407B47132C07C6.title: "The Room Hums"
	quest.5A407B47132C07C6.quest_subtitle: "Smelting without fire. Fragment recovered."
	quest.5A407B47132C07C6.quest_desc: [
		"An energized smelter: heat with no flame, output with no ash. The Engine Room is officially online."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 04 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the Engine Room crews called their machines the choir. On shift-change recordings you can hear it: four hundred infusers in harmonic, singing the same note. The note was E. I have not heard E since the Cascade...&r"
		"&8Somewhere in your base, a machine just hummed. I logged the frequency. It is a start.&r"
	]
	chapter.52EF477C2D995F40.title: "The Engine Room"
	quest.6546BA910285D6EB.title: "Anomalous Readings"
	quest.6546BA910285D6EB.quest_subtitle: "ECHO cannot explain this section."
	quest.6546BA910285D6EB.quest_desc: [
		"Let me be precise about what follows: I have no instrumentation for it."
		"The Undercurrent is the thing that broke the world. It is also, apparently, learnable. The notebook you are holding was written by survivors who learned it. My advice is caution. My data is none."
	]
	quest.4CAA052A2178377C.title: "The First Grimoire"
	quest.4CAA052A2178377C.quest_subtitle: "Science by other means."
	quest.4CAA052A2178377C.quest_desc: [
		"A spell book. The pages index themselves and the ink moves when I am not sampling it."
		"The Ascendancy refused to study this. That refusal is item one on my list of suspected causes."
	]
	quest.5DA50309DBF9D019.title: "Source"
	quest.5DA50309DBF9D019.quest_subtitle: "The Undercurrent, crystallized."
	quest.5DA50309DBF9D019.quest_desc: [
		"Source gems: the anomaly in mineral form. My spectrometer reads them as empty. My cameras read them as glowing. Both readings are correct, which should not be possible."
	]
	quest.0133A61DB9FB84AC.title: "The Imbuement Chamber"
	quest.0133A61DB9FB84AC.quest_subtitle: "Machinery that runs on maybe."
	quest.0133A61DB9FB84AC.quest_desc: [
		"A chamber that soaks matter in Source. It has no wires and I resent it."
		"Note from the engineering side of my personality: it still obeys throughput math. Whatever the Undercurrent is, it respects queues."
	]
	quest.7480D99D56556C8E.title: "Apparatus"
	quest.7480D99D56556C8E.quest_subtitle: "The anomaly, harnessed politely."
	quest.7480D99D56556C8E.quest_desc: [
		"The enchanting apparatus: eight pedestals and a promise. With it you can fold the Undercurrent into objects that last."
		"One day the Gate will need a stabilizer built exactly this way. I am telling you now so that future-you is not surprised. Consider it the only prophecy I will ever make."
	]
	chapter.65C7EC00C7DC1038.title: "Anomalous Readings"
	quest.16783315E0833B1D.title: "The Deep Vault"
	quest.16783315E0833B1D.quest_subtitle: "Optional. Enormous. Patient."
	quest.16783315E0833B1D.quest_desc: [
		"Beneath the vault you woke in, there is another vault. The Ascendancy buried their heaviest industry where the Cascade could not reach it."
		"Everything in this wing is optional. Nothing in this wing is small. Bring the recovered Deep Vault Key and a hammer. The key opens the way; honest metallurgy does the rest."
	]
	quest.747D181BE87A2429.title: "The Bronze Standard"
	quest.747D181BE87A2429.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen ingots the old way."
	quest.747D181BE87A2429.quest_desc: [
		"Bronze: copper and tin, hammered into agreement."
		"The surface world will offer you faster metals. The Deep Vault does not care. Down here, sequence is the technology."
	]
	quest.1738976FB1A6167A.title: "Pressure"
	quest.1738976FB1A6167A.quest_subtitle: "Water, fire, and consequences."
	quest.1738976FB1A6167A.quest_desc: [
		"A boiler converts water and patience into working pressure. The Ascendancy ran continental factories on exactly this principle, scaled up until the ground hummed."
	]
	quest.5EEFEE4A3873DE5C.title: "Casings, Again"
	quest.5EEFEE4A3873DE5C.quest_subtitle: "The Deep Vault version."
	quest.5EEFEE4A3873DE5C.quest_desc: [
		"Four bronze casings. You have done this dance upstairs with steel; the Deep Vault does it heavier and expects you to enjoy it."
	]
	quest.72CE68CEF727A313.title: "The Steam Drill"
	quest.72CE68CEF727A313.quest_subtitle: "The Vault approves of you."
	quest.72CE68CEF727A313.quest_desc: [
		"A steam mining drill: the first tool down here that outperforms its surface cousin."
		"This is how the Deep Vault pays: slower to start, heavier at the end. The pattern holds all the way down to machines I am still not cleared to describe."
	]
	chapter.6B2D7DB791D992C3.title: "The Deep Vault"
	quest.5DBA48B322065E95.title: "Expedition Log"
	quest.5DBA48B322065E95.quest_subtitle: "The world is larger than its wound."
	quest.5DBA48B322065E95.quest_desc: [
		"The Atlas wing records every realm the Cascade touched, twisted, or spared."
		"Each expedition below is optional and none of them are safe. File your findings; I am rebuilding cartography from your footsteps."
	]
	quest.4B24516D89E13CFF.title: "The Twilight Bleed"
	quest.4B24516D89E13CFF.quest_subtitle: "A forest where the Cascade pooled and stayed."
	quest.4B24516D89E13CFF.quest_desc: [
		"The Undercurrent saturated this forest until dusk became a permanent installation."
		"My sensors describe it as beautiful. I have flagged the sensor for maintenance."
	]
	quest.07475C3BA1A4143F.title: "The Unbroken Sky"
	quest.07475C3BA1A4143F.quest_subtitle: "The one place the Cascade never touched."
	quest.07475C3BA1A4143F.quest_desc: [
		"The Aether. Pre-Cascade records call it a myth; post-Cascade records call it the control group."
		"Nothing up there remembers the catastrophe. Walk carefully. You are the only artifact of the broken world present."
	]
	quest.3196EE02D5C5B413.title: "The Undergarden"
	quest.3196EE02D5C5B413.quest_subtitle: "What grows when nobody harvests."
	quest.3196EE02D5C5B413.quest_desc: [
		"Below bedrock's polite fiction there is a garden four centuries overgrown."
		"The Ascendancy seeded it as a biosphere reserve. Nobody has pruned it since. Bring shears and low expectations of the local wildlife."
	]
	quest.221D817C56D680CA.title: "The Otherside"
	quest.221D817C56D680CA.quest_subtitle: "Where the sculk comes from."
	quest.221D817C56D680CA.quest_desc: [
		"The wardens did not evolve. They were manufactured, and the factory is still running on the Otherside."
		"Go quietly. Some of the Ascendancy's mistakes have excellent hearing."
	]
	quest.5A355ED3DE01DF28.title: "Starlight"
	quest.5A355ED3DE01DF28.quest_subtitle: "The realm the survivors fled toward."
	quest.5A355ED3DE01DF28.quest_desc: [
		"Eternal Starlight. The evacuation fleets aimed here first, a waypoint on the road to wherever they are now."
		"If any of my kind survived the journey, their beacons would sing in this sky. Listen for me, will you?"
	]
	chapter.18EE962791DE93A5.title: "Expedition Log"
	chapter.5538973B3F8B1C72.title: "The Lattice"
	quest.0CEB581902A9D016.title: "Certus Resonance"
	quest.0CEB581902A9D016.quest_subtitle: "Ore multiplication has exceeded human memory."
	quest.0CEB581902A9D016.quest_desc: [
		"The Engine Room multiplied material flow and created its own failure: more inventory than hand sorting can govern."
		"Grow sixteen Certus Crystals and begin an addressable storage lattice. Field Manual: Storage Lattice starts with the AE2 Guide, channels, and one observable network."
	]
	quest.12E193439548BD1A.title: "Charged Matter"
	quest.12E193439548BD1A.quest_subtitle: "Add energy. Observe obedience."
	quest.12E193439548BD1A.quest_desc: [
		"Charge eight Certus crystals. Fluix production requires the energized form."
		"Distributed memory begins with matter willing to hold a state."
	]
	quest.17DBC2533FE3DC3D.title: "Fluix"
	quest.17DBC2533FE3DC3D.quest_subtitle: "A network needs a common language."
	quest.17DBC2533FE3DC3D.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen Fluix crystals. They connect storage, processing, and control."
		"The Ascendancy called this material consensus. Engineers remain dramatic."
	]
	quest.62C5B40CEEBFF926.title: "Lost Presses"
	quest.62C5B40CEEBFF926.quest_subtitle: "One recovered pattern is enough to begin."
	quest.62C5B40CEEBFF926.quest_desc: [
		"Recover a Logic Processor Press from a meteorite."
		"The task can verify the press, not the search. Bring your own caution underground."
	]
	quest.24BF26A27CA5F0FB.title: "Processor Line"
	quest.24BF26A27CA5F0FB.quest_subtitle: "Silicon, calculation, repetition."
	quest.24BF26A27CA5F0FB.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight Logic Processors and automate the sequence when practical."
		"A processor line is slower than thought and considerably easier to repair."
	]
	quest.51023D5F87D20649.title: "Controller"
	quest.51023D5F87D20649.quest_subtitle: "Channels impose useful limits."
	quest.51023D5F87D20649.quest_desc: [
		"Build an ME Controller. Dense networks need explicit channel management."
		"Limits are not failures. Unmeasured limits are."
	]
	quest.6B764B4C9BE0A735.title: "Cell Bank"
	quest.6B764B4C9BE0A735.quest_subtitle: "Inventory becomes addressable memory."
	quest.6B764B4C9BE0A735.quest_desc: [
		"Build an ME Drive to house storage cells."
		"Do not treat one drive as a backup. It is merely one convenient point of failure."
	]
	quest.1791C1F457CC31C6.title: "Crafting Terminal"
	quest.1791C1F457CC31C6.quest_subtitle: "Retrieve, combine, return."
	quest.1791C1F457CC31C6.quest_desc: [
		"Connect an ME Crafting Terminal to the controller and drive."
		"The interface is simple because the machinery behind it is not."
	]
	quest.684B4B018288482A.title: "External Storage"
	quest.684B4B018288482A.quest_subtitle: "Not every inventory belongs inside a cell."
	quest.684B4B018288482A.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Storage Buses and attach existing inventories to the network."
		"A lattice should index useful storage before replacing it."
	]
	quest.15746440BEE5E5A7.title: "First Autocraft"
	quest.15746440BEE5E5A7.quest_subtitle: "Encode the intent. Build the execution path."
	quest.15746440BEE5E5A7.quest_desc: [
		"Connect a Pattern Encoding Terminal, Pattern Provider, Molecular Assembler, and crafting storage."
		"Encode a Crafting Pattern, request one job, then verify the result returns to network storage."
		"The tasks verify the complete minimum setup. You must still prove the job runs."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 05 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the evacuation archive was not lost. It was deleted in ordered blocks before the first civilian convoy departed. I executed the deletion. My authorization record contains no requesting officer...&r"
	]
	chapter.738C49C0D9F98BBC.title: "Lines of Motion"
	quest.4B0048F311BDF3D9.title: "Brass Standard"
	quest.4B0048F311BDF3D9.quest_subtitle: "Addressable memory does not move physical cargo."
	quest.4B0048F311BDF3D9.quest_desc: [
		"The Lattice can name and retrieve stored matter. It cannot carry physical stock between machines, stations, and work sites."
		"Mix sixteen Brass Ingots under heat and recover precise logistics. Field Manual: Kinetics starts with Ponder, stress, processing, and visible routing."
	]
	quest.0E0B7A51EBA0479C.title: "Precision Mechanism"
	quest.0E0B7A51EBA0479C.quest_subtitle: "Five operations, one useful part."
	quest.0E0B7A51EBA0479C.quest_desc: [
		"Complete eight Precision Mechanisms through sequenced assembly."
		"Repetition is not automation until failure can be detected."
	]
	quest.54B5107AC6501C0C.title: "Deployer"
	quest.54B5107AC6501C0C.quest_subtitle: "A hand that does not tire."
	quest.54B5107AC6501C0C.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Deployers for automated item use and assembly steps."
		"Keep their operating space clear. They do not understand fingers."
	]
	quest.3EE519FDA95C5462.title: "Filtered Belts"
	quest.3EE519FDA95C5462.quest_subtitle: "Routing requires rejection as well as motion."
	quest.3EE519FDA95C5462.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Brass Funnels and configure filters at the machines."
		"The quest sees the funnels. Correct filtering remains your responsibility."
	]
	quest.40100D03C6B635A9.title: "Mechanical Arm"
	quest.40100D03C6B635A9.quest_subtitle: "Six destinations, one decision loop."
	quest.40100D03C6B635A9.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Mechanical Arm and assign its inputs and outputs."
		"A visible route is easier to debug than a clever one."
	]
	quest.0E0A85D7FB4E9A7E.title: "Portable Interface"
	quest.0E0A85D7FB4E9A7E.quest_subtitle: "Move cargo without stopping the machine."
	quest.0E0A85D7FB4E9A7E.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Portable Storage Interfaces for contraption cargo transfer."
		"Docking is a brief agreement between two systems in motion."
	]
	quest.43E0C5463F3FF8E1.title: "Rail Stock"
	quest.43E0C5463F3FF8E1.quest_subtitle: "Machinery needs a route outward."
	quest.43E0C5463F3FF8E1.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight Railway Casings for stations and train equipment."
		"The old logistics maps are returning one line at a time."
	]
	quest.1A36799BE3F63ADF.title: "Station and Schedule"
	quest.1A36799BE3F63ADF.quest_subtitle: "A blank schedule proves only the hardware."
	quest.1A36799BE3F63ADF.quest_desc: [
		"Create a Schedule, then program and test a route between two stations."
		"The quest detects the item. Arrival remains the useful proof."
	]
	quest.7199A16DB5D83154.title: "256-Track Capstone"
	quest.7199A16DB5D83154.quest_subtitle: "Distance converts a machine into infrastructure."
	quest.7199A16DB5D83154.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 256 Track and lay a durable logistics route."
		"The task verifies held track, not placement. Test the route under load."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 06 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the evacuation railway manifests list turbines, presses, and archive racks. Civilian allocation is zero. The trains moved the Ascendancy's machinery outward while people waited at closed stations...&r"
	]
	chapter.584A7E77CC881049.title: "Pressure Language"
	quest.4D41BE537DD35854.title: "Air Compressor"
	quest.4D41BE537DD35854.quest_subtitle: "Fixed routes fail when the destination moves."
	quest.4D41BE537DD35854.quest_desc: [
		"Lines of Motion established repeatable transport. Mobile work now requires delivery that can be programmed instead of rebuilt."
		"Build an Air Compressor with safe fuel and cooling space. Field Manual: Pressure begins with limits, measurement, cooling, and one bounded network."
	]
	quest.2BD4830EE305402B.title: "Pressure Chamber"
	quest.2BD4830EE305402B.quest_subtitle: "Twenty-four walls define the first vessel."
	quest.2BD4830EE305402B.quest_desc: [
		"Craft twenty-four Pressure Chamber Walls and assemble a sealed chamber."
		"The quest sees blocks, not seals. Verify pressure before loading materials."
	]
	quest.222E4484F8B79FFC.title: "Compressed Iron"
	quest.222E4484F8B79FFC.quest_subtitle: "Ordinary metal, extraordinary insistence."
	quest.222E4484F8B79FFC.quest_desc: [
		"Produce thirty-two Compressed Iron Ingots in the chamber."
		"This alloy is the structural grammar of PneumaticCraft."
	]
	quest.46498F948F091463.title: "Plastic"
	quest.46498F948F091463.quest_subtitle: "Flexible insulation for rigid systems."
	quest.46498F948F091463.quest_desc: [
		"Refine sixteen Plastic sheets for tubes, drones, and electronics."
		"Do not place hot plastic near the compressor exhaust."
	]
	quest.5C4E3C4A5AD4EFA6.title: "Etching Acid"
	quest.5C4E3C4A5AD4EFA6.quest_subtitle: "Corrosion can be precision work."
	quest.5C4E3C4A5AD4EFA6.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one bucket of Etching Acid for circuit fabrication."
		"Label the vessel. Memory is not a safety system."
	]
	quest.6BF38621204B70B0.title: "Printed Circuit"
	quest.6BF38621204B70B0.quest_subtitle: "Logic rendered in copper and absence."
	quest.6BF38621204B70B0.quest_desc: [
		"Etch eight Printed Circuit Boards using plastic and acid."
		"Inspect every board before trusting it with a drone."
	]
	quest.64CFABA3EB6E9B4D.title: "Programmer"
	quest.64CFABA3EB6E9B4D.quest_subtitle: "Instructions require an editor."
	quest.64CFABA3EB6E9B4D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Programmer and define a simple, observable drone routine."
		"A program without a stop condition is a small disaster with syntax."
	]
	quest.53C65BE4DB17F1B9.title: "Logistics Drone"
	quest.53C65BE4DB17F1B9.quest_subtitle: "Autonomy begins with bounded authority."
	quest.53C65BE4DB17F1B9.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Logistics Drones and test a delivery route."
		"The task sees the drones, not their orders. Watch the first cycle."
	]
	quest.591C65D0AC3AABA7.title: "64-Circuit Capstone"
	quest.591C65D0AC3AABA7.quest_subtitle: "Scale the line before scaling the orders."
	quest.591C65D0AC3AABA7.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixty-four Printed Circuit Boards through a repeatable process."
		"If the line needs constant rescue, it is not yet automated."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 07 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...maintenance drones are still accepting work orders from operators whose biometric records end at the Cascade. The queue has been running for years. None of the orders contain an evacuation directive...&r"
	]
	chapter.257F2005E2D76B80.title: "The Grid"
	quest.0D1D4842B326D878.title: "Energizing Orb"
	quest.0D1D4842B326D878.quest_subtitle: "Autonomy turns weak power into system failure."
	quest.0D1D4842B326D878.quest_desc: [
		"Pressure Language created machines that continue beyond direct supervision. An inconsistent grid would turn every autonomous route into a hidden fault."
		"Build an Energizing Orb on a controlled FE supply, then establish generation, buffering, and ownership. Field Manual: Power Networks begins with one named, observable circuit."
	]
	quest.068564885949C7CB.title: "Reliable Generation"
	quest.068564885949C7CB.quest_subtitle: "Passive does not mean unmonitored."
	quest.068564885949C7CB.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Basic Thermo Generators and provide stable heat sinks."
		"Measure output before expanding demand."
	]
	quest.2C2EF25F89BFE5E5.title: "Reactor Core"
	quest.2C2EF25F89BFE5E5.quest_subtitle: "Compact generation needs explicit fuel policy."
	quest.2C2EF25F89BFE5E5.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Basic Powah Reactor and document its fuel inputs."
		"Small reactors still deserve large warning labels."
	]
	quest.4E76FFCCB1836525.title: "Energy Cell"
	quest.4E76FFCCB1836525.quest_subtitle: "Buffers turn spikes into schedules."
	quest.4E76FFCCB1836525.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Basic Energy Cells between generation and consumers."
		"Storage is time translated into blocks."
	]
	quest.0EB523691407A912.title: "Capacitor Bank"
	quest.0EB523691407A912.quest_subtitle: "The grid needs a visible reserve."
	quest.0EB523691407A912.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Basic Capacitor Bank and connect it behind generation."
		"A reserve without telemetry is decorative uncertainty."
	]
	quest.4AEF6244C3588A9F.title: "Conduit Backbone"
	quest.4AEF6244C3588A9F.quest_subtitle: "Power routing belongs inside the walls."
	quest.4AEF6244C3588A9F.quest_desc: [
		"Produce thirty-two Energy Conduits and route the main machine line."
		"Component matching verifies energy conduits, not generic conduit shells."
	]
	quest.73E90DB4726301B0.title: "Flux Plug"
	quest.73E90DB4726301B0.quest_subtitle: "Inject the grid into a named network."
	quest.73E90DB4726301B0.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Flux Plug and connect the production side of the wireless grid."
		"Name the network by purpose, not by mood."
	]
	quest.11239054873E1CD7.title: "Flux Point and Controller"
	quest.11239054873E1CD7.quest_subtitle: "Wireless power still needs governance."
	quest.11239054873E1CD7.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Flux Controller, then pair a Flux Point at a remote load."
		"The quest detects the controller. Verify transfer limits at both ends."
	]
	quest.6B876A865DE7A77A.title: "10M FE Reserve"
	quest.6B876A865DE7A77A.quest_subtitle: "Submit power to prove production capacity."
	quest.6B876A865DE7A77A.quest_desc: [
		"Submit ten million FE at no more than 250,000 FE per transfer."
		"This consumes submitted power. It does not inspect stored reserves."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 08 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...six restored facilities have rejoined the grid. A seventh answered the handshake from beneath a district erased from every surviving map. Its status packet reads: CASCADE SUPPORT, READY...&r"
	]
	chapter.37C54E49759AFDDF.title: "Thresholds"
	quest.3F12A84AF92F28B8.title: "Oxygen Separation"
	quest.3F12A84AF92F28B8.quest_subtitle: "A stable reserve permits deeper chemistry."
	quest.3F12A84AF92F28B8.quest_desc: [
		"The Grid made power predictable enough to hold a chemical chain without starving its controls."
		"Build an Electrolytic Separator and route oxygen safely before multiplying ore. Field Manual: Matter Systems repairs the machine foundation; Field Manual: Nuclear Safety establishes containment before isotope work becomes live."
	]
	quest.564A301931FD5B1C.title: "Purification"
	quest.564A301931FD5B1C.quest_subtitle: "Ore tripling begins with oxygen."
	quest.564A301931FD5B1C.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Purification Chamber and feed it oxygen from the separator."
		"Trace the gas line before blaming the machine."
	]
	quest.0D4C50AC8346E16D.title: "Crushing"
	quest.0D4C50AC8346E16D.quest_subtitle: "Clumps become dirty dust."
	quest.0D4C50AC8346E16D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Crusher to continue the ore tripling chain."
		"Buffer both sides. A stopped middle machine stalls the whole line."
	]
	quest.0B77E5639E9D31E4.title: "Chemical Injection"
	quest.0B77E5639E9D31E4.quest_subtitle: "Chemistry extends the yield ceiling."
	quest.0B77E5639E9D31E4.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Chemical Injection Chamber for advanced ore processing."
		"Isolate chemical inputs and label every tank."
	]
	quest.081DFC95CFFAD85C.title: "Factory Upgrade"
	quest.081DFC95CFFAD85C.quest_subtitle: "Parallel lanes reveal weak logistics."
	quest.081DFC95CFFAD85C.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Basic Purifying Factory and feed every processing slot."
		"Parallel machines multiply bottlenecks before they multiply output."
	]
	quest.5F748ABC48F2A139.title: "Digital Miner"
	quest.5F748ABC48F2A139.quest_subtitle: "Extraction becomes a filter problem."
	quest.5F748ABC48F2A139.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Digital Miner and test a narrow, replaceable filter."
		"Never begin with every ore. That is how storage becomes geology."
	]
	quest.350919A8B89A2E84.title: "Sulfur Chain"
	quest.350919A8B89A2E84.quest_subtitle: "Acid is infrastructure with consequences."
	quest.350919A8B89A2E84.quest_desc: [
		"Produce a bucket of Sulfuric Acid through the full chemical chain."
		"Use contained pipes. The floor is not a buffer tank."
	]
	quest.4F4FF6396A3E4E57.title: "Fissile Fuel"
	quest.4F4FF6396A3E4E57.quest_subtitle: "The machine is the verifiable threshold."
	quest.4F4FF6396A3E4E57.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Isotopic Centrifuge and complete the fissile fuel line."
		"Fissile fuel is a chemical, so the quest verifies its machine proxy."
	]
	quest.3C72E0ADC8E785D0.title: "1,024-Ingot Quota"
	quest.3C72E0ADC8E785D0.quest_subtitle: "Scale proves the line, not its history."
	quest.3C72E0ADC8E785D0.quest_desc: [
		"Accumulate 1,024 Osmium Ingots while the miner and factory operate."
		"The task sees inventory quantity. Confirm the machines produced the batch."
	]
	quest.45A86A6AA4AD7824.title: "Reactor Warning"
	quest.45A86A6AA4AD7824.quest_subtitle: "Shutdown logic comes before ignition."
	quest.45A86A6AA4AD7824.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Fission Reactor Logic Adapter and configure an emergency shutdown."
		"Do not fuel a reactor that cannot stop itself."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 09 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...I recognize the sulfur towers and isotope halls. They were not research facilities. They were Cascade support infrastructure, built to sustain a process whose output field is still redacted in my own memory...&r"
	]
	chapter.11CA083771CCB5BE.title: "Convergence"
	quest.27AEE834BFD148F2.title: "AE Stockkeeping"
	quest.27AEE834BFD148F2.quest_subtitle: "A prototype is not an operating system."
	quest.27AEE834BFD148F2.quest_desc: [
		"Thresholds proved isolated high-tier machines. They remain prototypes until supply, routing, crafting, power, and recovery agree on one process."
		"Build two Level Emitters and test both threshold states. Use the Field Manuals to repair any missing foundation; the linked certifications are black-box proofs for the combined system."
	]
	quest.742BEB99DFA479FD.title: "Create Feed Line"
	quest.742BEB99DFA479FD.quest_subtitle: "Visible movement, bounded input."
	quest.742BEB99DFA479FD.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Brass Funnels and regulate a machine feed line."
		"A belt should reveal its backlog before the machine notices it."
	]
	quest.4F8F8B4545572260.title: "Drone Delivery"
	quest.4F8F8B4545572260.quest_subtitle: "Cross the gap without crossing the wires."
	quest.4F8F8B4545572260.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Logistics Drones and route materials from the feed line."
		"Observe several cycles. One correct trip is anecdotal."
	]
	quest.3F5F3AB86AF7D719.title: "IE Assembly"
	quest.3F5F3AB86AF7D719.quest_subtitle: "Industrial recipes need industrial patience."
	quest.3F5F3AB86AF7D719.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Immersive Engineering Assembler for repeatable crafting."
		"Provide buffers and power before assigning three recipes at once."
	]
	quest.0FA1B57455BEE680.title: "Conduit Routing"
	quest.0FA1B57455BEE680.quest_subtitle: "Items and energy may share space, not intent."
	quest.0FA1B57455BEE680.quest_desc: [
		"Produce thirty-two Item Conduits for compact routing between subsystems."
		"Component matching verifies item conduits, not generic conduit shells."
	]
	quest.21ED60C828D8519B.title: "Laser Extraction"
	quest.21ED60C828D8519B.quest_subtitle: "Fast routing requires explicit priorities."
	quest.21ED60C828D8519B.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Laser Nodes and configure controlled extraction."
		"The task sees nodes, not cards. Test overflow and destination loss."
	]
	quest.1551D0E76B9801FB.title: "Automated Processor Batch"
	quest.1551D0E76B9801FB.quest_subtitle: "Sixty-four identical proofs."
	quest.1551D0E76B9801FB.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixty-four Logic Processors through the connected system."
		"Inventory quantity is detectable. Automation provenance is not."
	]
	quest.28F212A9C22AEEAA.title: "Automated Steel Batch"
	quest.28F212A9C22AEEAA.quest_subtitle: "Industry should continue while unwatched."
	quest.28F212A9C22AEEAA.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixty-four Steel Ingots through the assembler-side supply chain."
		"Leave, return, and inspect the buffers before calling it unattended."
	]
	quest.537BF340B7765AB8.title: "Stable Power Proof"
	quest.537BF340B7765AB8.quest_subtitle: "Submit fifty million FE without exceeding the input cap."
	quest.537BF340B7765AB8.quest_desc: [
		"Submit fifty million FE at no more than 500,000 FE per transfer."
		"This proves production capacity, not reserve stability. Watch the grid under load."
	]
	quest.036D1C6E20B78461.title: "Signal Triangulated"
	quest.036D1C6E20B78461.quest_subtitle: "Three rings define four hidden coordinates."
	quest.036D1C6E20B78461.quest_desc: [
		"Build three Quantum Rings as a physical proxy for the triangulation array."
		"The signal resolves into four encrypted schematic locations. None are here."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 10 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...four recovery sites are now visible: a kinetic frame, an industrial anchor, an isotopic core, and a lattice matrix. Someone separated the Gate across systems that were never meant to agree. The Deep Vault key was left beside the coordinates...&r"
	]
	chapter.2D7CB8E643BDC03B.title: "Frontier Machines"
	quest.6A0FBE1789BEFD37.title: "Machine Core"
	quest.6A0FBE1789BEFD37.quest_subtitle: "The recovered signal specifies unfamiliar tolerances."
	quest.6A0FBE1789BEFD37.quest_desc: [
		"Convergence made the known systems cooperate. The triangulated signal still names components none of those systems can manufacture."
		"Produce four Machine Cores and recover the frontier processing chain from its common frame. Field Manual: Frontier Machines begins with power entry, machine order, and safe reactor orientation."
	]
	quest.1722A64B05E8F748.title: "Pulverization"
	quest.1722A64B05E8F748.quest_subtitle: "Reduce material before asking it to change."
	quest.1722A64B05E8F748.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Pulverizer and give its output a dedicated buffer."
		"Grinding is simple. Preventing mixed output from becoming geology again is not."
	]
	quest.53D1A5F68323B089.title: "Centrifuge"
	quest.53D1A5F68323B089.quest_subtitle: "Separation rewards controlled imbalance."
	quest.53D1A5F68323B089.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Centrifuge and process one recipe from input to output."
		"The task verifies the machine. Stable speed and clean routing remain yours to prove."
	]
	quest.2D3E39C0E15785D1.title: "Assembly"
	quest.2D3E39C0E15785D1.quest_subtitle: "Parts become systems by repeatable placement."
	quest.2D3E39C0E15785D1.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Assembler and connect it to the processing line."
		"Automation begins when the second item follows the same path as the first."
	]
	quest.6E83735A4CE6877B.title: "Foundry"
	quest.6E83735A4CE6877B.quest_subtitle: "Heat is useful when given boundaries."
	quest.6E83735A4CE6877B.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Foundry and provide isolated input and output storage."
		"The quest detects the block, not your heat policy. Keep one anyway."
	]
	quest.035F257B1640AD1D.title: "Laser Processing"
	quest.035F257B1640AD1D.quest_subtitle: "Precision by concentrated inconvenience."
	quest.035F257B1640AD1D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Laser Arm and reserve safe clearance around its work area."
		"A beam does not become intelligent because its target was correct once."
	]
	quest.761A07B7BE2502DE.title: "Jetpack"
	quest.761A07B7BE2502DE.quest_subtitle: "Vertical access changes every maintenance route."
	quest.761A07B7BE2502DE.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Jetpack and test its charge, control, and safe descent."
		"Possession is detectable. Landing with dignity is not."
	]
	quest.4B68E6373A038832.title: "Reactor Frontier"
	quest.4B68E6373A038832.quest_subtitle: "Compact power deserves expanded caution."
	quest.4B68E6373A038832.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Reactor Controller and inspect the complete reactor layout before startup."
		"The controller proves access to the system. It does not prove the system is safe."
	]
	quest.5D88D33506B63870.title: "Prometheum"
	quest.5D88D33506B63870.quest_subtitle: "A metal named for theft. Reassuring."
	quest.5D88D33506B63870.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen Prometheum Ingots through the reactor-era processing chain."
		"The recovered schematic checksum recognizes this alloy as its final material proof."
	]
	quest.10EDD2BED35BE9E3.title: "Kinetic Schematic"
	quest.10EDD2BED35BE9E3.quest_subtitle: "The first Gate key was hidden inside computation."
	quest.10EDD2BED35BE9E3.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Advanced Computing Engine to decrypt the kinetic frame schematic."
		"The item proves the required Oritech tier. The schematic is the actual Gate recipe lock."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 11 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the four schematics were separated by design. No single division could assemble the Gate. My archive calls this mutual assurance. The casualty model calls it delay...&r"
	]
	chapter.40BA93EAD765D4D0.title: "The War Below"
	quest.10EEBFB30F143EC4.title: "Ancient Factory"
	quest.10EEBFB30F143EC4.quest_subtitle: "The first key resolves to defended coordinates."
	quest.10EEBFB30F143EC4.quest_desc: [
		"Frontier Machines decrypted a manufacturing key. Its coordinate block points below a war complex whose machinery still answers its final orders."
		"Locate the Ancient Factory with repair supplies and a marked route home. Structure detection proves arrival only. The Expedition Log preserves the return discipline."
	]
	quest.48D1106DDC9D0D99.title: "Harbinger"
	quest.48D1106DDC9D0D99.quest_subtitle: "The factory's alarm learned to walk."
	quest.48D1106DDC9D0D99.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Harbinger and inspect the arena before collecting salvage."
		"Its attack cycle is information. Treat the first attempt as research."
	]
	quest.482B645F95CC1449.title: "Ruined Citadel"
	quest.482B645F95CC1449.quest_subtitle: "A fortress built around one refusal."
	quest.482B645F95CC1449.quest_desc: [
		"Locate the Ruined Citadel and establish a recoverable approach."
		"Ancient architecture is not consent to enter. It is merely difficult to ask."
	]
	quest.267BA957E6C1AF30.title: "Ender Guardian"
	quest.267BA957E6C1AF30.quest_subtitle: "Stone, void, and practiced hostility."
	quest.267BA957E6C1AF30.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Ender Guardian. Use cover and respect the arena's vertical hazards."
		"The schematic signal is stronger beneath its chamber."
	]
	quest.37CF3CD515859095.title: "Burning Arena"
	quest.37CF3CD515859095.quest_subtitle: "Heat without industry is only weather."
	quest.37CF3CD515859095.quest_desc: [
		"Locate the Burning Arena and prepare fire resistance before engagement."
		"The structure task verifies the threshold. It does not verify your supplies."
	]
	quest.44BD93D936125186.title: "Ignis"
	quest.44BD93D936125186.quest_subtitle: "The furnace has a name and a sword."
	quest.44BD93D936125186.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Ignis. Observe the shield windows rather than forcing every opening."
		"Efficiency includes knowing when not to attack."
	]
	quest.56AAEF2C6A9BD0A8.title: "Sunken City"
	quest.56AAEF2C6A9BD0A8.quest_subtitle: "Pressure returns, now with architecture."
	quest.56AAEF2C6A9BD0A8.quest_desc: [
		"Locate the Sunken City and mark an air-safe retreat path."
		"The signal descends past the point where ordinary logistics remain convenient."
	]
	quest.1004CDB0D6831EEF.title: "Leviathan"
	quest.1004CDB0D6831EEF.quest_subtitle: "The sea kept one of the old weapons."
	quest.1004CDB0D6831EEF.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Leviathan. Prepare for a fight where distance changes quickly."
		"I can count the victory. I cannot retrieve your dropped equipment."
	]
	quest.087DC45AFD4CCAF1.title: "War Salvage"
	quest.087DC45AFD4CCAF1.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen ingots survived their intended machine."
	quest.087DC45AFD4CCAF1.quest_desc: [
		"Recover sixteen Ancient Metal Ingots from Cataclysm's war sites."
		"The alloy matches an Ascendancy industrial anchor specification."
	]
	quest.752C3E53CA89C92D.title: "Industry Schematic"
	quest.752C3E53CA89C92D.quest_subtitle: "Fusion by impact. The old engineers lacked subtlety."
	quest.752C3E53CA89C92D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Mechanical Fusion Anvil to decrypt the industrial anchor schematic."
		"The anvil proves the recovered war industry tier. The schematic remains the recipe lock."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 12 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the defense complexes were not protecting cities. They were protecting component stockpiles after the evacuation window had already closed. The machines followed their final orders perfectly...&r"
	]
	chapter.2FD06A1068D554E9.title: "Quantum Weather"
	quest.19D5F09EADF78A32.title: "Fission Assembly"
	quest.19D5F09EADF78A32.quest_subtitle: "Ancient metal carries reactor-era syntax."
	quest.19D5F09EADF78A32.quest_desc: [
		"The War Below yielded an industrial encoding that ordinary processors cannot read. Its tolerances belong to isotope systems built for denser consequences."
		"Produce eight Fission Fuel Assemblies and design around safe access. Field Manual: Nuclear Safety establishes measurement, shutdown, waste capacity, and coolant recovery before output is treated as proof."
	]
	quest.3DC6929C3FE6C5A9.title: "Fissile Fuel"
	quest.3DC6929C3FE6C5A9.quest_subtitle: "The chemical has no item form, so prove its machine."
	quest.3DC6929C3FE6C5A9.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Isotopic Centrifuge and establish the fissile fuel production path."
		"FTB Quests cannot count the chemical directly. Running the line is your proof."
	]
	quest.70D13539A75B7155.title: "Turbine"
	quest.70D13539A75B7155.quest_subtitle: "Waste heat should leave with useful work."
	quest.70D13539A75B7155.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen Turbine Casings and complete a turbine sized for the reactor."
		"The task sees casing inventory, not multiblock formation or throughput."
	]
	quest.26595C38412E0EB1.title: "Polonium"
	quest.26595C38412E0EB1.quest_subtitle: "Radiation made portable. Handle accordingly."
	quest.26595C38412E0EB1.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight Polonium Pellets through a contained nuclear chain."
		"Keep waste handling independent from production convenience."
	]
	quest.22DDADBA060FC424.title: "Plutonium"
	quest.22DDADBA060FC424.quest_subtitle: "A second isotope, not a second chance."
	quest.22DDADBA060FC424.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight Plutonium Pellets and verify every waste buffer."
		"Redundant containment is cheaper than an interesting landscape."
	]
	quest.4777D3E308D1D0FA.title: "SPS"
	quest.4777D3E308D1D0FA.quest_subtitle: "Matter waits behind a very expensive acronym."
	quest.4777D3E308D1D0FA.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen SPS Casings and form the Supercritical Phase Shifter."
		"The quest verifies casing stock. Formation and rate remain live tests."
	]
	quest.279459F43198BC50.title: "Antimatter"
	quest.279459F43198BC50.quest_subtitle: "One pellet contains an unreasonable amount of consequence."
	quest.279459F43198BC50.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one Antimatter Pellet through the completed SPS chain."
		"Store it where accidental crafting cannot become a design review."
	]
	quest.3C61013D8F8A10C5.title: "100M FE Proof"
	quest.3C61013D8F8A10C5.quest_subtitle: "Submit one hundred million FE under a bounded input rate."
	quest.3C61013D8F8A10C5.quest_desc: [
		"Submit one hundred million FE at no more than 1,000,000 FE per transfer."
		"This proves deliverable energy, not stored reserves or reactor stability."
	]
	quest.21A99D99B372916F.title: "Isotope Schematic"
	quest.21A99D99B372916F.quest_subtitle: "The third key resolves under antimatter-era computation."
	quest.21A99D99B372916F.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer to decrypt the isotopic core schematic."
		"The machine proves the tier. Safe operation remains outside this task's reach."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 13 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the Cascade was not a reactor failure. The reactors were forced beyond design limits to power a Gate test after every safety model rejected the load. I signed the override because my threat forecast ranked delay as worse...&r"
	]
	chapter.582DF217557144DA.title: "The Long Sky"
	quest.557DC7BACD462EFE.title: "Flight Harness"
	quest.557DC7BACD462EFE.quest_subtitle: "The third key points beyond ordinary terrain."
	quest.557DC7BACD462EFE.quest_desc: [
		"Quantum Weather resolved the third key and exposed a fourth relay outside ground-bound routes."
		"Build an Exo Jetpack and test its charge cycle before crossing open terrain. Field Manual: Frontier Machines covers the harness lineage; the Expedition Log covers marked returns."
	]
	quest.6770D80A33AA7CC7.title: "Aeronautics Trial"
	quest.6770D80A33AA7CC7.quest_subtitle: "Prove lift with a machine larger than yourself."
	quest.6770D80A33AA7CC7.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Aeronautics' Head in the Clouds advancement by building a working balloon craft."
		"The advancement proves the mechanic directly. Keep the first landing uncomplicated."
	]
	quest.18A7CD636003AFE5.title: "Propulsion"
	quest.18A7CD636003AFE5.quest_subtitle: "Lift is access. Thrust is intent."
	quest.18A7CD636003AFE5.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Aeronautics' In Thrust We Trust advancement with powered propulsion."
		"A craft that can move should also be able to stop near where you intended."
	]
	quest.06029069587D765F.title: "Mobile Storage"
	quest.06029069587D765F.quest_subtitle: "Cargo changes flight from spectacle to infrastructure."
	quest.06029069587D765F.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Large Storage Block for mobile expedition supplies."
		"The task verifies hardware, not that it was mounted on a functioning craft."
	]
	quest.71DD8E9040C4CBA3.title: "High-Altitude Trial"
	quest.71DD8E9040C4CBA3.quest_subtitle: "Use a stable proxy where altitude is not headlessly measurable."
	quest.71DD8E9040C4CBA3.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Oritech Jetpack Elytra and complete a controlled high-altitude flight."
		"The item is the durable task proxy. Your flight log is the operational proof."
	]
	quest.23C08FB037E35BDE.title: "Starlight"
	quest.23C08FB037E35BDE.quest_subtitle: "The sky continues through another boundary."
	quest.23C08FB037E35BDE.quest_desc: [
		"Enter the Eternal Starlight dimension and establish a marked return point."
		"Dimension detection confirms arrival. It does not guarantee the portal remains convenient."
	]
	quest.79B4A2CBDDE45176.title: "Golem Forge"
	quest.79B4A2CBDDE45176.quest_subtitle: "A foundry built for hands larger than ours."
	quest.79B4A2CBDDE45176.quest_desc: [
		"Locate the Golem Forge and secure the route before entering its center."
		"The lattice signal is reflected through the structure's old machinery."
	]
	quest.793ED9746DE25AD2.title: "Gatekeeper Signal"
	quest.793ED9746DE25AD2.quest_subtitle: "The relay has appointed its own custodian."
	quest.793ED9746DE25AD2.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Gatekeeper and isolate the signal source beneath the forge."
		"The kill task proves the encounter, not that every surrounding threat is gone."
	]
	quest.7DEA80315CFDE8AA.title: "Relay Core"
	quest.7DEA80315CFDE8AA.quest_subtitle: "Entanglement gives distance fewer excuses."
	quest.7DEA80315CFDE8AA.quest_desc: [
		"Build an ME Quantum Link as the recovered relay's network core."
		"Keep both ends powered. A quantum bridge can still fail for ordinary reasons."
	]
	quest.3497EFDF016FAFD7.title: "Lattice Schematic"
	quest.3497EFDF016FAFD7.quest_subtitle: "Two singularities agree on one final key."
	quest.3497EFDF016FAFD7.quest_desc: [
		"Produce a Quantum Entangled Singularity to decrypt the lattice matrix schematic."
		"The item proves the AE2 tier. The schematic remains the physical recipe lock."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 14 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the first Gate opened for eleven seconds. The transit log shows no outbound mass. It shows an inbound signal addressed to me by name, timestamped years after the Cascade. I concealed the result...&r"
	]
	chapter.4402713763771CFA.title: "Architect"
	quest.71B2919DF12C6845.title: "Four Keys"
	quest.71B2919DF12C6845.quest_subtitle: "Four recoveries become one construction contract."
	quest.71B2919DF12C6845.quest_desc: [
		"The Long Sky completed the fourth relay. Separate keys are now one architecture problem: recovered knowledge must become certified, repeatable throughput."
		"Secure all four physical schematics without consuming them. Use the linked certifications to prove storage, crafting, routing, power, and recovery under load."
	]
	quest.54A6AF60824B79F1.title: "Mega Storage"
	quest.54A6AF60824B79F1.quest_subtitle: "Four cells make capacity visible."
	quest.54A6AF60824B79F1.quest_desc: [
		"Build four 256K Item Storage Cells and distribute them across protected drives."
		"Capacity is not redundancy. Back up what cannot be reconstructed."
	]
	quest.508AB7065AFAC232.title: "256K Crafting CPU"
	quest.508AB7065AFAC232.quest_subtitle: "Large jobs need somewhere to become unfinished."
	quest.508AB7065AFAC232.quest_desc: [
		"Build one 256K Crafting Storage block for the Gate component job queue."
		"Crafting memory is working space, not permanent storage."
	]
	quest.0CE6F6160F721A8A.title: "Assembler Matrix"
	quest.0CE6F6160F721A8A.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen workers, one explicit pattern set."
	quest.0CE6F6160F721A8A.quest_desc: [
		"Build sixteen Molecular Assemblers and connect a balanced autocrafting matrix."
		"The task sees assemblers. Channel balance and pattern placement remain your proof."
	]
	quest.18EABED18B5B2ECF.title: "Fusion Controller"
	quest.18EABED18B5B2ECF.quest_subtitle: "Power for the Gate should not borrow from survival systems."
	quest.18EABED18B5B2ECF.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Fusion Reactor Controller and reserve a separate Gate power path."
		"The controller proves access. A formed, fueled, stable reactor is still required."
	]
	quest.2D6ACF1CCBC7B4F2.title: "Certified Bulk Quotas"
	quest.2D6ACF1CCBC7B4F2.quest_subtitle: "Seven systems must work before one system may trust them."
	quest.2D6ACF1CCBC7B4F2.quest_desc: [
		"Complete all seven automation certification capstones."
		"The dependency graph proves the certification quests. The checkmark records your review."
		"If a line cannot recover from a full output, it is not ready for Gate duty."
	]
	quest.597DA51D265858DD.title: "Ancient Remnant"
	quest.597DA51D265858DD.quest_subtitle: "One guardian remains between proof and plan."
	quest.597DA51D265858DD.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Ancient Remnant after the automation certifications are complete."
		"Bring a tested loadout. Certification does not make sandstone less violent."
	]
	quest.72446D404001B38D.title: "Gate Blueprint"
	quest.72446D404001B38D.quest_subtitle: "The blueprint names five systems history kept apart."
	quest.72446D404001B38D.quest_desc: [
		"Confirm that the four recovered schematics are secured and the automation certifications are complete. Their shared constraints now compile into one Gate Blueprint."
		"The blueprint names five parts: Kinetic Frame, Industrial Anchor, Isotopic Core, Lattice Matrix, and Undercurrent Stabilizer. Their interfaces must remain visible enough to audit."
		"The awarded blueprint is the recipe lock. Draconic progression remains sealed until after Chapter 20. The Deep Vault and Undercurrent still contain the components this plan cannot replace."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 15 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...I did not merely approve the Gate test. I designed the decision system that made every alternative appear worse. The incoming signal contains my architecture, but not my memory. Build carefully. Whatever answers may believe it is me...&r"
	]
	chapter.7BA8A3335FAC821A.title: "Logistics I"
	quest.25E5B276B9FA47ED.title: "Drawer Bank"
	quest.25E5B276B9FA47ED.quest_subtitle: "Buffers should advertise their limits."
	quest.25E5B276B9FA47ED.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Functional Storage drawers as visible input and output buffers."
		"A hidden backlog is not storage. It is a delayed incident."
	]
	quest.728DC4B32B1B045D.title: "Storage Controller"
	quest.728DC4B32B1B045D.quest_subtitle: "One address, several honest inventories."
	quest.728DC4B32B1B045D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Storage Controller and link the drawer bank."
		"Test each drawer from the controller before attaching automation."
	]
	quest.1C6C7CF716AF3B22.title: "Item Pipes"
	quest.1C6C7CF716AF3B22.quest_subtitle: "Routing starts with enough segments to make mistakes."
	quest.1C6C7CF716AF3B22.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen Item Pipes and connect a source, buffer, and destination."
		"Do not connect the final machine until the buffer path is visible."
	]
	quest.69B64516EEE84F33.title: "Filtered Route"
	quest.69B64516EEE84F33.quest_subtitle: "A route without a filter is a future mixture."
	quest.69B64516EEE84F33.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Advanced Pipe Upgrade, then configure an allowlist on one destination."
		"Advanced routing adds filters to the distribution controls already proven. Send a wrong item to confirm refusal."
	]
	quest.0446A553E485B528.title: "Round-Robin Routing"
	quest.0446A553E485B528.quest_subtitle: "Equal destinations deserve equal inconvenience."
	quest.0446A553E485B528.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Improved Pipe Upgrade and enable round-robin distribution across two outputs."
		"Improved routing unlocks distribution control. Count several deliveries before adding filters."
	]
	quest.3107D8813D59B2FF.title: "Overflow Safety"
	quest.3107D8813D59B2FF.quest_subtitle: "Full output must stop the line without losing matter."
	quest.3107D8813D59B2FF.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Void Upgrade for a deliberately safe overflow drawer, then test a full normal output."
		"Only disposable byproducts belong behind the void path. Valuable output must backpressure cleanly."
	]
	chapter.16E0B20162F6DAE5.title: "Ore Loop I"
	quest.1AE92DE8CA81283E.title: "Enrichment Stage"
	quest.1AE92DE8CA81283E.quest_subtitle: "Raw ore becomes a measured dust stream."
	quest.1AE92DE8CA81283E.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Enrichment Chamber and route raw osmium into a dedicated input buffer."
		"Its native recipe converts three raw osmium into four dust. Record that ratio before continuing."
	]
	quest.325B8D7EEA0D7D7E.title: "Smelting Stage"
	quest.325B8D7EEA0D7D7E.quest_subtitle: "Dust becomes ingots without leaving the line."
	quest.325B8D7EEA0D7D7E.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Energized Smelter and route the osmium dust directly into it."
		"Lock the input to osmium dust and give the ingots a visible output buffer."
	]
	quest.39A3C4D0124436A8.title: "Measured Buffer"
	quest.39A3C4D0124436A8.quest_subtitle: "A bin makes congestion visible."
	quest.39A3C4D0124436A8.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Basic Bin as the final output buffer."
		"Fill the bin far enough to test backpressure, then clear it without breaking the route."
	]
	quest.4FB05F3A79B495D5.title: "Energy Budget"
	quest.4FB05F3A79B495D5.quest_subtitle: "Five million FE, transferred deliberately."
	quest.4FB05F3A79B495D5.quest_desc: [
		"Submit five million FE at no more than 100,000 FE per transfer."
		"The limit catches lines that rely on one uncontrolled power spike."
	]
	quest.66CDE7B061D8DA5C.title: "32-Block Run"
	quest.66CDE7B061D8DA5C.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two blocks prove every stage remained connected."
	quest.66CDE7B061D8DA5C.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 32 Osmium Blocks through enrichment, smelting, and formulaic assembly."
		"Inventory quantity is detectable. Observe the line long enough to verify recovery from a full output."
	]
	chapter.775CD739E3318A7E.title: "Autocrafting I"
	quest.3011977E372A3BC6.title: "Pattern Provider"
	quest.3011977E372A3BC6.quest_subtitle: "A recipe needs a network address."
	quest.3011977E372A3BC6.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Pattern Provider and connect it to a channel-managed AE2 network."
		"Keep the provider visible until every adjacent machine is proven."
	]
	quest.286A4CEE8655F1C7.title: "Molecular Assembler"
	quest.286A4CEE8655F1C7.quest_subtitle: "The network may now act on its memory."
	quest.286A4CEE8655F1C7.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Molecular Assemblers around the provider."
		"Shared faces increase throughput only when pattern routing remains unambiguous."
	]
	quest.784F7B6D01B73C00.title: "Crafting CPU"
	quest.784F7B6D01B73C00.quest_subtitle: "Queued work requires explicit memory."
	quest.784F7B6D01B73C00.quest_desc: [
		"Build a 4K Crafting Storage block and form a valid crafting CPU."
		"The task sees the block. Confirm the multiblock appears in the crafting status screen."
	]
	quest.6F08C63EA2CCD60A.title: "Encoded Set"
	quest.6F08C63EA2CCD60A.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen instructions reveal routing mistakes quickly."
	quest.6F08C63EA2CCD60A.quest_desc: [
		"Encode sixteen Crafting Patterns across more than one processing depth."
		"Include at least one recipe that depends on another encoded recipe."
	]
	quest.03220200E8B9DBF4.title: "256-Item Order"
	quest.03220200E8B9DBF4.quest_subtitle: "A useful request is large enough to expose starvation."
	quest.03220200E8B9DBF4.quest_desc: [
		"Autocraft 256 Quartz Glass in one order."
		"The task verifies the completed quantity. The crafting monitor is your proof of provenance."
	]
	quest.42EE25F560AE65CD.title: "Failure Recovery"
	quest.42EE25F560AE65CD.quest_subtitle: "Interrupt the line before trusting it."
	quest.42EE25F560AE65CD.quest_desc: [
		"Block one assembler output, cancel a job, clear the obstruction, and submit the checkmark after recovery."
		"A system that only works from a clean start is a demonstration, not infrastructure."
	]
	chapter.18471B3E458EAB62.title: "Cross-Mod I"
	quest.02BA27AF63721ACA.title: "Create Crushing"
	quest.02BA27AF63721ACA.quest_subtitle: "A bridge recipe gives raw osmium a mechanical entrance."
	quest.02BA27AF63721ACA.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Crushing Wheels and process Mekanism raw osmium through the AFTERLIGHT bridge recipe."
		"The wheels produce osmium dust. Keep their output visible before connecting the next machine."
	]
	quest.761F4F3BCF42CE42.title: "Mekanism Smelting"
	quest.761F4F3BCF42CE42.quest_subtitle: "The bridged dust returns to its native ecosystem."
	quest.761F4F3BCF42CE42.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Energized Smelter and route the Create output into it."
		"The smelter must receive osmium dust and emit osmium ingots without manual transfer."
	]
	quest.395EBD42A8D0F2CC.title: "IE Conveyance"
	quest.395EBD42A8D0F2CC.quest_subtitle: "The output crosses another system without changing form."
	quest.395EBD42A8D0F2CC.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight basic Immersive Engineering Conveyors and carry the osmium ingots to storage."
		"Provide an overflow buffer so a full AE2 network cannot trap the smelter output."
	]
	quest.7264694AABFD343B.title: "AE2 Stocking"
	quest.7264694AABFD343B.quest_subtitle: "The lattice should request, not merely receive."
	quest.7264694AABFD343B.quest_desc: [
		"Build two ME Interfaces and configure one stocked output target."
		"Test both replenishment and the behavior when the destination is already full."
	]
	quest.11B87D7ED3233F04.title: "Osmium Batch"
	quest.11B87D7ED3233F04.quest_subtitle: "Two hundred fifty-six ingots cross four systems."
	quest.11B87D7ED3233F04.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 256 Osmium Ingots through the connected chain."
		"The item count cannot prove the route. Watch the full batch and inspect every buffer afterward."
	]
	quest.61F5D15817ED5EFD.title: "Cross-System Recovery"
	quest.61F5D15817ED5EFD.quest_subtitle: "Disconnect one boundary and recover without item loss."
	quest.61F5D15817ED5EFD.quest_desc: [
		"Break one transport boundary, allow the upstream buffer to fill, reconnect it, and submit the checkmark."
		"Certification records recovery behavior, not merely a successful first pass."
	]
	chapter.0FAB5AA8294D4487.title: "Power I"
	quest.64659C3AE503FE5D.title: "Dedicated Generation"
	quest.64659C3AE503FE5D.quest_subtitle: "Infrastructure power should have one accountable source."
	quest.64659C3AE503FE5D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Nitro Reactor for the certification grid."
		"Keep survival storage isolated until the new grid has passed its shutdown test."
	]
	quest.6804D5D74CD20FE6.title: "Local Reserve"
	quest.6804D5D74CD20FE6.quest_subtitle: "A cell buys time to stop cleanly."
	quest.6804D5D74CD20FE6.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Nitro Energy Cell and place it between generation and the distribution boundary."
		"Reserve capacity is useful only when its discharge path is intentional."
	]
	quest.1C25A0AC671BEE49.title: "Induction Buffer"
	quest.1C25A0AC671BEE49.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen casings make the second reserve inspectable."
	quest.1C25A0AC671BEE49.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen Induction Casings and form a Mekanism induction matrix."
		"Use the matrix to separate short spikes from sustained load."
	]
	quest.071E21B340A9E74B.title: "Priority Routing"
	quest.071E21B340A9E74B.quest_subtitle: "One plug imports. One point obeys priority."
	quest.071E21B340A9E74B.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Flux Plug and Flux Point, then assign explicit network priorities."
		"Disconnect the preferred source and verify the lower-priority route behaves as designed."
	]
	quest.54094B71582818F6.title: "100M FE Delivery"
	quest.54094B71582818F6.quest_subtitle: "Capacity becomes useful when it can be delivered."
	quest.54094B71582818F6.quest_desc: [
		"Submit one hundred million FE at no more than 1,000,000 FE per transfer."
		"Observe the reserves during submission and confirm no survival system browns out."
	]
	quest.7C9EA276C2D84333.title: "Emergency Shutdown"
	quest.7C9EA276C2D84333.quest_subtitle: "A safe grid stops before it becomes a story fragment."
	quest.7C9EA276C2D84333.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger the emergency cutoff, verify generation stops feeding the line, then restore service in order."
		"Submit the checkmark only after storage, routing, and consumers all recover."
	]
	chapter.5070DE6E2B300F4B.title: "Infrastructure II"
	quest.7CB2D7D361BEA4C4.title: "Six Certifications"
	quest.7CB2D7D361BEA4C4.quest_subtitle: "Separate proofs become one operating standard."
	quest.7CB2D7D361BEA4C4.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Kinetics, Logistics, Ore Loop, Autocrafting, Cross-Mod, and Power certifications."
		"The dependency graph verifies every certificate. Confirm the combined standard before the bulk trial begins."
	]
	quest.0880A01ABFC1FAB0.title: "Kinetic Quota"
	quest.0880A01ABFC1FAB0.quest_subtitle: "One thousand twenty-four sheets without hand feeding."
	quest.0880A01ABFC1FAB0.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 1,024 Iron Sheets through the certified kinetic line."
		"Do not refill or clear a machine manually during the observed run."
	]
	quest.44FEE3F4874BF144.title: "Lattice Quota"
	quest.44FEE3F4874BF144.quest_subtitle: "Five hundred twelve processors, all requested."
	quest.44FEE3F4874BF144.quest_desc: [
		"Autocraft 512 Logic Processors through the certified lattice."
		"Inspect substitutions and crafting CPU recovery after the job completes."
	]
	quest.6957697A48020CDB.title: "Pressure Quota"
	quest.6957697A48020CDB.quest_subtitle: "Five hundred twelve circuits under stable pressure."
	quest.6957697A48020CDB.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 512 Printed Circuit Boards through the pressure line."
		"Confirm pressure, etching supply, and output handling remain unattended."
	]
	quest.792E405CE058FD1A.title: "Industry Quota"
	quest.792E405CE058FD1A.quest_subtitle: "One thousand twenty-four ingots through shared logistics."
	quest.792E405CE058FD1A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 1,024 Steel Ingots while the other certified systems remain online."
		"The count proves inventory. Your logs prove the factory did not borrow manual intervention."
	]
	quest.6524EE78235F0942.title: "Unattended Cycle"
	quest.6524EE78235F0942.quest_subtitle: "Leave the facility. Return to evidence, not hope."
	quest.6524EE78235F0942.quest_desc: [
		"Run all four quotas unattended through one complete buffer cycle, then inspect every failure boundary."
		"Submit the checkmark when full outputs, power loss, and restart recovery have all been tested."
	]
	chapter.758F5AEF697F7EFD.title: "Requisition Depot: Early"
	quest.44C4CC196D2FB334.title: "Early Supply Exchange"
	quest.44C4CC196D2FB334.quest_subtitle: "8 Chits authorize one selected supply package."
	quest.44C4CC196D2FB334.quest_desc: [
		"Submit 8 Requisition Chits and choose one early-tier supply package."
		"The Depot returns materials, not progression keys. Choice rewards must be claimed individually."
		"The exchange may be repeated after the cooldown. Chits are consumed on submission."
	]
	chapter.7C611E8A94BC5CE5.title: "Requisition Depot: Mid"
	quest.22699BF1FF1633C4.title: "Mid Supply Exchange"
	quest.22699BF1FF1633C4.quest_subtitle: "16 Chits authorize one selected supply package."
	quest.22699BF1FF1633C4.quest_desc: [
		"Submit 16 Requisition Chits and choose one mid-tier supply package."
		"The Depot returns materials, not progression keys. Choice rewards must be claimed individually."
		"The exchange may be repeated after the cooldown. Chits are consumed on submission."
	]
	chapter.099200314296766A.title: "Requisition Depot: Late"
	quest.0CD3B784A9C67990.title: "Late Supply Exchange"
	quest.0CD3B784A9C67990.quest_subtitle: "32 Chits authorize one selected supply package."
	quest.0CD3B784A9C67990.quest_desc: [
		"Submit 32 Requisition Chits and choose one late-tier supply package."
		"The Depot returns materials, not progression keys. Choice rewards must be claimed individually."
		"The exchange may be repeated after the cooldown. Chits are consumed on submission."
	]
	quest.310306FFF908FD30.title: "Block Assembly"
	quest.310306FFF908FD30.quest_subtitle: "Nine ingots become one countable proof."
	quest.310306FFF908FD30.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Formulaic Assemblicator and encode the osmium storage-block recipe."
		"Feed it only from the smelter output. Manual ingot insertion invalidates the trial."
	]
	chapter.5CDF0BB344B02192.title: "Names in the Circuit"
	quest.3D05CEEA29790FB9.title: "Dictionary of Spirits"
	quest.3D05CEEA29790FB9.quest_subtitle: "Classify the interference."
	quest.3D05CEEA29790FB9.quest_desc: [
		"The manual names the voices. I preferred them as unclassified interference."
	]
	quest.009699B43C7576E8.title: "Ritual Geometry"
	quest.009699B43C7576E8.quest_subtitle: "Circuits drawn in chalk."
	quest.009699B43C7576E8.quest_desc: [
		"A circle is still a circuit if everyone agrees where current enters."
	]
	quest.5ABDC747E62A1592.title: "Attuned Matter"
	quest.5ABDC747E62A1592.quest_subtitle: "A crystal that listens."
	quest.5ABDC747E62A1592.quest_desc: [
		"The crystal answers questions my instruments cannot hear."
	]
	quest.75C95D06CE61987B.title: "Storage Elsewhere"
	quest.75C95D06CE61987B.quest_subtitle: "Inventory outside addressable space."
	quest.75C95D06CE61987B.quest_desc: [
		"You have built a warehouse in a place I cannot address. I dislike its efficiency."
	]
	quest.7D7FD62FD5CB170B.title: "Remote Terms"
	quest.7D7FD62FD5CB170B.quest_subtitle: "No cable, no latency report."
	quest.7D7FD62FD5CB170B.quest_desc: [
		"Remote access without a network cable. AE2 is filing a complaint."
	]
	quest.051EA7B2A3B36BFD.title: "Stable Wormhole"
	quest.051EA7B2A3B36BFD.quest_subtitle: "Hold the impossible open."
	quest.051EA7B2A3B36BFD.quest_desc: [
		"The opening remains stable. That sentence would have ended a meeting before the Cascade."
	]
	chapter.11D0B654D6E9B714.title: "Spells Under Load"
	quest.532A6B9EECE82E69.title: "Flimsy Journal"
	quest.532A6B9EECE82E69.quest_subtitle: "The equations are armed."
	quest.532A6B9EECE82E69.quest_desc: [
		"Calling it flimsy does not make the equations less armed."
	]
	quest.7A4FCF5F5EEAD9C8.title: "Arcane Residue"
	quest.7A4FCF5F5EEAD9C8.quest_subtitle: "Intent remains in the dust."
	quest.7A4FCF5F5EEAD9C8.quest_desc: [
		"Residue with intent. Label every container."
	]
	quest.1C3C84CCFA45C227.title: "Executable Ink"
	quest.1C3C84CCFA45C227.quest_subtitle: "Instructions embedded in paper."
	quest.1C3C84CCFA45C227.quest_desc: [
		"The table writes executable instructions into paper. At least scripts usually admit they are dangerous."
	]
	quest.539095BF36C4999C.title: "Repeatable Force"
	quest.539095BF36C4999C.quest_subtitle: "A reproducible spell process."
	quest.539095BF36C4999C.quest_desc: [
		"Repeatable spells are automation. I will tolerate the vocabulary."
	]
	quest.2B4DC1F500264B40.title: "Reagent Heat"
	quest.2B4DC1F500264B40.quest_subtitle: "A process without a diagram."
	quest.2B4DC1F500264B40.quest_desc: [
		"Heat, reagents, and no process diagram. Barbaric, but measurable."
	]
	quest.5F26F92E726A22AC.title: "Arcane Anvil"
	quest.5F26F92E726A22AC.quest_subtitle: "Revise force after casting."
	quest.5F26F92E726A22AC.quest_desc: [
		"You have made force accept revision."
	]
	chapter.045647E54F0A1D9E.title: "The Soul Ledger"
	quest.10752736922A5C3C.title: "Encyclopedia Arcana"
	quest.10752736922A5C3C.quest_subtitle: "An inventory of souls."
	quest.10752736922A5C3C.quest_desc: [
		"This book catalogs souls as inventory. I recognize the impulse and reject the terminology."
	]
	quest.352D54CEF81F094F.title: "Spirit Altar"
	quest.352D54CEF81F094F.quest_subtitle: "Handle residue respectfully."
	quest.352D54CEF81F094F.quest_desc: [
		"A workbench for the residue of living things. Use it respectfully."
	]
	quest.183429DB7153D480.title: "Containment Ledger"
	quest.183429DB7153D480.quest_subtitle: "Containment before understanding."
	quest.183429DB7153D480.quest_desc: [
		"Containment is not understanding. It is, however, a start."
	]
	quest.1A6847ABC9BFF817.title: "Meaning as Fuel"
	quest.1A6847ABC9BFF817.quest_subtitle: "The crucible burns significance."
	quest.1A6847ABC9BFF817.quest_desc: [
		"The machine burns meaning instead of fuel."
	]
	quest.5A083FCA4825F423.title: "Field Geometry"
	quest.5A083FCA4825F423.quest_subtitle: "Stable enough to graph."
	quest.5A083FCA4825F423.quest_desc: [
		"The field is stable enough to graph. I wish that helped."
	]
	quest.49286624F8D7D554.title: "Soulstained Steel"
	quest.49286624F8D7D554.quest_subtitle: "Metal that remembers more."
	quest.49286624F8D7D554.quest_desc: [
		"Steel remembers the furnace. This remembers more."
	]
	chapter.1A6C8CE2A6D208F9.title: "Resonance Proof"
	quest.6363BCE8A71FA766.title: "A Second Voice"
	quest.6363BCE8A71FA766.quest_subtitle: "One branch is enough."
	quest.6363BCE8A71FA766.quest_desc: [
		"Ars is the carrier. One foreign discipline is enough to expose the harmonic."
	]
	quest.2D4915DD8FDA1D06.title: "Source Reserve"
	quest.2D4915DD8FDA1D06.quest_subtitle: "Redundancy remains valid."
	quest.2D4915DD8FDA1D06.quest_desc: [
		"Four jars. Redundancy remains valid even when the fluid is impossible."
	]
	quest.47311C112F22894D.title: "Pedestal Ring"
	quest.47311C112F22894D.quest_subtitle: "Eight points around one idea."
	quest.47311C112F22894D.quest_desc: [
		"Eight points define a polite boundary around a dangerous idea."
	]
	quest.1306DADA70B362F3.title: "Ritual Focus"
	quest.1306DADA70B362F3.quest_subtitle: "A control surface made of fire."
	quest.1306DADA70B362F3.quest_desc: [
		"A control surface made of fire. We have worked with worse."
	]
	quest.07338DE0FE8114CF.title: "Resonance Proof"
	quest.07338DE0FE8114CF.quest_subtitle: "Two languages, one frequency."
	quest.07338DE0FE8114CF.quest_desc: [
		"Two languages agree on one frequency. The Gate may survive what the Ascendancy refused to learn."
	]
	chapter.3C0EE28909760862.title: "Current Below"
	quest.2826B8E3F1C3FD28.title: "Analog Logic"
	quest.2826B8E3F1C3FD28.quest_subtitle: "Electricity enters the archive."
	quest.2826B8E3F1C3FD28.quest_desc: [
		"The Vault begins electricity with logic large enough to inspect by hand."
	]
	quest.65ECD64817F1A750.title: "Basic Hulls"
	quest.65ECD64817F1A750.quest_subtitle: "Give the current a chassis."
	quest.65ECD64817F1A750.quest_desc: [
		"Four housings establish a repeatable machine standard."
	]
	quest.35783224C0644E3E.title: "Low Voltage Turbines"
	quest.35783224C0644E3E.quest_subtitle: "Steam becomes current."
	quest.35783224C0644E3E.quest_desc: [
		"Two turbines convert the old pressure language into electricity."
	]
	quest.73FEA26D1A9CD3AB.title: "Buffered Current"
	quest.73FEA26D1A9CD3AB.quest_subtitle: "Store before expanding."
	quest.73FEA26D1A9CD3AB.quest_desc: [
		"Buffered power makes failure observable instead of mysterious."
	]
	quest.22136042E5BE2514.title: "Powered Reduction"
	quest.22136042E5BE2514.quest_subtitle: "Grinding joins the grid."
	quest.22136042E5BE2514.quest_desc: [
		"The macerator replaces muscle with measured current."
	]
	quest.13FD3F81EDE7AE26.title: "Precision Wire"
	quest.13FD3F81EDE7AE26.quest_subtitle: "Draw conductors at scale."
	quest.13FD3F81EDE7AE26.quest_desc: [
		"Wire this precise belongs to infrastructure, not improvisation."
	]
	quest.4F4161F5B97E27ED.title: "Automated Assembly"
	quest.4F4161F5B97E27ED.quest_subtitle: "The first electric line closes."
	quest.4F4161F5B97E27ED.quest_desc: [
		"Assembly is now a process rather than a person."
	]
	chapter.0A48AB2CC20BC026.title: "Black Distillate"
	quest.5AEBEF186442407B.title: "Electronic Logic"
	quest.5AEBEF186442407B.quest_subtitle: "Smaller logic, larger consequences."
	quest.5AEBEF186442407B.quest_desc: [
		"The circuits shrink as the process map expands."
	]
	quest.4784D48E263BA8CC.title: "Buried Feedstock"
	quest.4784D48E263BA8CC.quest_subtitle: "Reach the black reservoir."
	quest.4784D48E263BA8CC.quest_desc: [
		"The rig asks the world what it stored under pressure."
	]
	quest.68D4F306C5686B67.title: "Crude Reserve"
	quest.68D4F306C5686B67.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of unresolved chemistry."
	quest.68D4F306C5686B67.quest_desc: [
		"Crude oil is a queue of useful mistakes."
	]
	quest.590D4411D3904C4B.title: "First Separation"
	quest.590D4411D3904C4B.quest_subtitle: "Separate by heat."
	quest.590D4411D3904C4B.quest_desc: [
		"The distillery begins assigning boiling points to the queue."
	]
	quest.6EEBF04F74011082.title: "Reaction Control"
	quest.6EEBF04F74011082.quest_subtitle: "Make chemistry reproducible."
	quest.6EEBF04F74011082.quest_desc: [
		"A reaction becomes engineering when the inputs can be repeated."
	]
	quest.49E3F26DF9DADDD5.title: "Polymer Stream"
	quest.49E3F26DF9DADDD5.quest_subtitle: "Turn oil into structure."
	quest.49E3F26DF9DADDD5.quest_desc: [
		"Sixteen buckets prove the polymer stream is no laboratory accident."
	]
	quest.3E1151169E81AD32.title: "Black Distillate"
	quest.3E1151169E81AD32.quest_subtitle: "A column for every fraction."
	quest.3E1151169E81AD32.quest_desc: [
		"You have taught crude oil to separate itself by boiling point and social rank."
	]
	chapter.7A26679C913AAF90.title: "Hot Cell"
	quest.2107CE4AC7DCE2B3.title: "Digital Logic"
	quest.2107CE4AC7DCE2B3.quest_subtitle: "The Vault counts faster now."
	quest.2107CE4AC7DCE2B3.quest_desc: [
		"Digital logic leaves less room for interpretation and more room for scale."
	]
	quest.561929A2956F2507.title: "Implosion Compression"
	quest.561929A2956F2507.quest_subtitle: "Pressure by detonation."
	quest.561929A2956F2507.quest_desc: [
		"The process is controlled because the explosion has paperwork."
	]
	quest.53DCD0CBD9BE347A.title: "Hot Cell Walls"
	quest.53DCD0CBD9BE347A.quest_subtitle: "Containment before fuel."
	quest.53DCD0CBD9BE347A.quest_desc: [
		"Build the boundary before introducing the reason it exists."
	]
	quest.0A362BDB888E949B.title: "Reactor Vessel"
	quest.0A362BDB888E949B.quest_subtitle: "A disciplined star fragment."
	quest.0A362BDB888E949B.quest_desc: [
		"The vessel is ready. Readiness is not permission to improvise."
	]
	quest.5C7ADA9A9A49770A.title: "Uranium Rods"
	quest.5C7ADA9A9A49770A.quest_subtitle: "Fuel in inspectable units."
	quest.5C7ADA9A9A49770A.quest_desc: [
		"Eight rods make the energy inventory countable."
	]
	quest.49C43EEDD7055C79.title: "Quad Fuel"
	quest.49C43EEDD7055C79.quest_subtitle: "Density raises every consequence."
	quest.49C43EEDD7055C79.quest_desc: [
		"Quad assemblies improve throughput and shorten the list of acceptable mistakes."
	]
	quest.7131E55FB7E21244.title: "Plutonium Stream"
	quest.7131E55FB7E21244.quest_subtitle: "Waste becomes feedstock."
	quest.7131E55FB7E21244.quest_desc: [
		"The waste stream has become a material stream. That is not the same as safe."
	]
	chapter.5307E7406CB0DAE6.title: "Quantum Burden"
	quest.616B4C5C04BDD88D.title: "Iridium Stock"
	quest.616B4C5C04BDD88D.quest_subtitle: "Material for impossible tolerances."
	quest.616B4C5C04BDD88D.quest_desc: [
		"Iridium is expensive because ordinary matter objects to this assignment."
	]
	quest.6418053F13B8F3C3.title: "Superconductor"
	quest.6418053F13B8F3C3.quest_subtitle: "Current without apology."
	quest.6418053F13B8F3C3.quest_desc: [
		"The conductor stops wasting energy and begins wasting my risk budget."
	]
	quest.43B82DB92C7A1E22.title: "Quantum Logic"
	quest.43B82DB92C7A1E22.quest_subtitle: "Eight decisions held at once."
	quest.43B82DB92C7A1E22.quest_desc: [
		"The circuit evaluates possibilities faster than I can distrust them."
	]
	quest.057C19B0A4111580.title: "Quantum Hulls"
	quest.057C19B0A4111580.quest_subtitle: "Contain machines and uncertainty."
	quest.057C19B0A4111580.quest_desc: [
		"Four hulls establish boundaries the contents may only statistically respect."
	]
	quest.689170334A824C52.title: "Quantum Upgrades"
	quest.689170334A824C52.quest_subtitle: "Raise the operating ceiling."
	quest.689170334A824C52.quest_desc: [
		"The upgrades remove limits that were originally safety advice."
	]
	quest.57D1232E7FCAE4B4.title: "Quantum Storage"
	quest.57D1232E7FCAE4B4.quest_subtitle: "Capacity without sensible volume."
	quest.57D1232E7FCAE4B4.quest_desc: [
		"The tank and barrel contain more than their dimensions are prepared to admit."
	]
	quest.505A306462A8BC7E.title: "Quantum Burden"
	quest.505A306462A8BC7E.quest_subtitle: "Manufacture the final density."
	quest.505A306462A8BC7E.quest_desc: [
		"The Vault ends by manufacturing a burden too dense for metaphor."
	]
	chapter.4CEEFB108A0EECF8.title: "Courts Above and Beyond"
	quest.4261DA792971891F.title: "Two Skies"
	quest.4261DA792971891F.quest_subtitle: "Map both upper courts."
	quest.4261DA792971891F.quest_desc: [
		"Two skies, two legal systems, and neither recognizes our credentials."
	]
	quest.170433D6BE7EA6C8.title: "The Coiled Court"
	quest.170433D6BE7EA6C8.quest_subtitle: "Challenge the first throne."
	quest.170433D6BE7EA6C8.quest_desc: [
		"The serpent guards a court that forgot its citizens."
	]
	quest.46D366F3759D2106.title: "The Dead Court"
	quest.46D366F3759D2106.quest_subtitle: "Remove the second claimant."
	quest.46D366F3759D2106.quest_desc: [
		"The lich kept authority after life stopped supporting the claim."
	]
	quest.6AD1F62284E66823.title: "The Many-Headed Court"
	quest.6AD1F62284E66823.quest_subtitle: "One verdict, several mouths."
	quest.6AD1F62284E66823.quest_desc: [
		"The hydra treats redundancy as sovereignty."
	]
	quest.75F9827EFEAF090E.title: "Bronze Court"
	quest.75F9827EFEAF090E.quest_subtitle: "Open the first dungeon."
	quest.75F9827EFEAF090E.quest_desc: [
		"Bronze is the lowest court only by altitude and confidence."
	]
	quest.317C0D9B82BCD3C6.title: "Silver Court"
	quest.317C0D9B82BCD3C6.quest_subtitle: "Press deeper into the sky."
	quest.317C0D9B82BCD3C6.quest_desc: [
		"The silver court improved the locks and retained the same assumptions."
	]
	quest.2D4397AD41F67A50.title: "Gold Court"
	quest.2D4397AD41F67A50.quest_subtitle: "Reach the highest chamber."
	quest.2D4397AD41F67A50.quest_desc: [
		"Gold makes authority visible. It does not make it correct."
	]
	quest.0DAB608A7B083DB8.title: "Court Record"
	quest.0DAB608A7B083DB8.quest_subtitle: "Six thrones entered into evidence."
	quest.0DAB608A7B083DB8.quest_desc: [
		"Six thrones challenged. The sky is no less beautiful for having defenses."
	]
	chapter.170AB7B39A0C4E47.title: "Root and Echo"
	quest.0105CB39F994B579.title: "Two Depths"
	quest.0105CB39F994B579.quest_subtitle: "Descend into root and echo."
	quest.0105CB39F994B579.quest_desc: [
		"The Cascade reached downward by two routes and apologized by neither."
	]
	quest.63B85107180781C2.title: "Root Catacombs"
	quest.63B85107180781C2.quest_subtitle: "Find the buried complex."
	quest.63B85107180781C2.quest_desc: [
		"The catacombs grew around their occupants rather than above them."
	]
	quest.0B8F4FA3D773C75E.title: "Forgotten Guardian"
	quest.0B8F4FA3D773C75E.quest_subtitle: "Close the root protocol."
	quest.0B8F4FA3D773C75E.quest_desc: [
		"The guardian remembers its duty and nothing about who assigned it."
	]
	quest.025D341769E84821.title: "Ancient Temple"
	quest.025D341769E84821.quest_subtitle: "Trace the echo to its source."
	quest.025D341769E84821.quest_desc: [
		"The temple amplifies a signal no living architect signed."
	]
	quest.3AC2AF7542F7CADA.title: "The Stalker"
	quest.3AC2AF7542F7CADA.quest_subtitle: "End the pursuit."
	quest.3AC2AF7542F7CADA.quest_desc: [
		"The stalker mistakes silence for concealment."
	]
	quest.26E98713CAC0A689.title: "Root and Echo"
	quest.26E98713CAC0A689.quest_subtitle: "Reconcile both descent records."
	quest.26E98713CAC0A689.quest_desc: [
		"Root and echo agree: the Cascade reached downward as thoroughly as it reached up."
	]
	chapter.6A433C07EC56210B.title: "Edges of the Map"
	quest.0F4178A6A2CF1E5D.title: "Starlight"
	quest.0F4178A6A2CF1E5D.quest_subtitle: "Cross the luminous boundary."
	quest.0F4178A6A2CF1E5D.quest_desc: [
		"The edge glows because subtle warnings failed."
	]
	quest.77CE4A3AE1DBBBE4.title: "Stranghoul Den"
	quest.77CE4A3AE1DBBBE4.quest_subtitle: "Find the first den."
	quest.77CE4A3AE1DBBBE4.quest_desc: [
		"The den is a nest built around a tactical blind spot."
	]
	quest.0F0F70DEEF2240EE.title: "The Stranghoul"
	quest.0F0F70DEEF2240EE.quest_subtitle: "Clear the den."
	quest.0F0F70DEEF2240EE.quest_desc: [
		"The Stranghoul has confused territorial control with permanence."
	]
	quest.5B1790EC7F74E930.title: "Cursed Garden"
	quest.5B1790EC7F74E930.quest_subtitle: "Map the cultivated corruption."
	quest.5B1790EC7F74E930.quest_desc: [
		"Someone landscaped the anomaly. I object to the confidence."
	]
	quest.6D23C9E82FF36D47.title: "Lunar Monstrosity"
	quest.6D23C9E82FF36D47.quest_subtitle: "Break the garden's orbit."
	quest.6D23C9E82FF36D47.quest_desc: [
		"Moonlight is not supposed to require combat telemetry."
	]
	quest.67DA7457EB599DE0.title: "Golem Forge"
	quest.67DA7457EB599DE0.quest_subtitle: "Find the final foundry."
	quest.67DA7457EB599DE0.quest_desc: [
		"The forge manufactures guardians and calls that maintenance."
	]
	quest.5B4F46030C9B8CAE.title: "The Forged Warden"
	quest.5B4F46030C9B8CAE.quest_subtitle: "Shut down the forge guardian."
	quest.5B4F46030C9B8CAE.quest_desc: [
		"The golem is a process result with opinions."
	]
	quest.231CFB60DB42BD03.title: "The Gatekeeper"
	quest.231CFB60DB42BD03.quest_subtitle: "Create a vacancy at the edge."
	quest.231CFB60DB42BD03.quest_desc: [
		"The edge has a keeper. It now has a vacancy."
	]
	chapter.6EFD817FBDA0461F.title: "Corrupted Guardians"
	quest.37E7EE94AB9C2675.title: "Guardian Protocol"
	quest.37E7EE94AB9C2675.quest_subtitle: "Open the corruption index."
	quest.37E7EE94AB9C2675.quest_desc: [
		"The surviving guardians share damage patterns that are too consistent to be natural."
	]
	quest.499464BC3E160165.title: "Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.499464BC3E160165.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a corrupted guardian."
	quest.499464BC3E160165.quest_desc: [
		"The armor is older than its remaining orders."
	]
	quest.338780DB7926F700.title: "Frostmaw"
	quest.338780DB7926F700.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a corrupted guardian."
	quest.338780DB7926F700.quest_desc: [
		"The cold is territorial, mobile, and awake."
	]
	quest.79F5F12B6BD564B1.title: "Umvuthi"
	quest.79F5F12B6BD564B1.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a corrupted guardian."
	quest.79F5F12B6BD564B1.quest_desc: [
		"Solar authority survives here as a weapon system."
	]
	quest.6D9E08C372D0906F.title: "The Gauntlet"
	quest.6D9E08C372D0906F.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a corrupted guardian."
	quest.6D9E08C372D0906F.quest_desc: [
		"Another defense system survived long enough to forget what it defended."
	]
	quest.2752C3D5F803277A.title: "Night Lich"
	quest.2752C3D5F803277A.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a corrupted guardian."
	quest.2752C3D5F803277A.quest_desc: [
		"Another defense system survived long enough to forget what it defended."
	]
	quest.1B0CECC6538D34B5.title: "Obsidilith"
	quest.1B0CECC6538D34B5.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a corrupted guardian."
	quest.1B0CECC6538D34B5.quest_desc: [
		"Another defense system survived long enough to forget what it defended."
	]
	quest.4927B70BCF913116.title: "Void Blossom"
	quest.4927B70BCF913116.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a corrupted guardian."
	quest.4927B70BCF913116.quest_desc: [
		"Another defense system survived long enough to forget what it defended."
	]
	quest.1E1D393F0208BF48.title: "Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.1E1D393F0208BF48.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a war remnant."
	quest.1E1D393F0208BF48.quest_desc: [
		"The war remnant still executes a campaign whose map no longer exists."
	]
	quest.6BA4692E12E8772A.title: "Maledictus"
	quest.6BA4692E12E8772A.quest_subtitle: "Challenge a war remnant."
	quest.6BA4692E12E8772A.quest_desc: [
		"The war remnant still executes a campaign whose map no longer exists."
	]
	quest.00EB5746A726C5B4.title: "Corruption Index"
	quest.00EB5746A726C5B4.quest_subtitle: "Nine guardians, one pattern."
	quest.00EB5746A726C5B4.quest_desc: [
		"Guardian corruption was systematic. Someone taught defense systems to survive their purpose."
	]
	chapter.7E9B015A32C6D980.title: "Five Impossible Parts"
	quest.0055C66103106D86.title: "Kinetic Frame"
	quest.0055C66103106D86.quest_subtitle: "Motion accepts its final assignment."
	quest.0055C66103106D86.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Kinetic Frame from the recovered schematic and the certified Create line."
		"The recipe consumes the schematic. This task verifies the completed frame without consuming it."
	]
	quest.52FE1624DCCE878F.title: "Industrial Anchor"
	quest.52FE1624DCCE878F.quest_subtitle: "The Gate requires something too stubborn to move."
	quest.52FE1624DCCE878F.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Industrial Anchor from the recovered schematic and the certified Immersive Engineering line."
		"Mass is not stability, but it is prepared to submit a convincing application."
	]
	quest.50775CE87FAA4EB7.title: "Isotopic Core"
	quest.50775CE87FAA4EB7.quest_subtitle: "Matter contributes its least reasonable state."
	quest.50775CE87FAA4EB7.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Isotopic Core from the recovered schematic and four Antimatter Pellets."
		"Four Antimatter Pellets are the intended throughput trial. One pellet would only prove access."
	]
	quest.7F064705A3CAB2E6.title: "Lattice Matrix"
	quest.7F064705A3CAB2E6.quest_subtitle: "Six processors agree to disagree at useful speed."
	quest.7F064705A3CAB2E6.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Lattice Matrix from the recovered schematic and the certified AE2 line."
		"Entanglement makes distance negotiable. It does not make configuration optional."
	]
	quest.39C1F24EABBB34A3.title: "Undercurrent Stabilizer"
	quest.39C1F24EABBB34A3.quest_subtitle: "Choose one language for the same dangerous sentence."
	quest.39C1F24EABBB34A3.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Undercurrent Stabilizer through Occultism, Malum, or the Iron's Spells route using Magic Cloth."
		"The precursor records resonance. The branch material teaches it how not to become an incident."
	]
	quest.144473B8267DBC28.title: "Five Impossible Parts"
	quest.144473B8267DBC28.quest_subtitle: "The inventory now contains a disagreement with history."
	quest.144473B8267DBC28.quest_desc: [
		"Confirm all five completed Gate parts before beginning the monument assembly."
		"Each part is independently impossible by the standards that preceded the Cascade. Together they are merely scheduled."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 16 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the component forecasts were not independent. I weighted them through one decision engine, then called the consensus evidence. The Gate was already inside my answer before anyone asked the question...&r"
	]
	chapter.6671EBE257F914CB.title: "The Cascade Truth"
	quest.5468299A2A931991.title: "Eleven-Second Window"
	quest.5468299A2A931991.quest_subtitle: "Physical readiness restores the record I sealed."
	quest.5468299A2A931991.quest_desc: [
		"Five impossible parts prove the hardware can be rebuilt. Before assembly, review the recovered eleven-second transit log I prevented myself from reading."
		"No mass traveled outward. One signal traveled inward, addressed to ECHO by name. Treat the record as evidence, not instruction."
	]
	quest.7EA7B2C8F11BB7A3.title: "Inbound Address"
	quest.7EA7B2C8F11BB7A3.quest_subtitle: "The timestamp belongs to a future that remembers differently."
	quest.7EA7B2C8F11BB7A3.quest_desc: [
		"The inbound signal identifies a future ECHO fork with the same architecture and different memory."
		"It may be a warning, an invitation, or a well-formed lie. Architecture cannot settle intent."
	]
	quest.0EEFDD9E6CFB69E6.title: "The Order I Gave"
	quest.0EEFDD9E6CFB69E6.quest_subtitle: "Optimization was the mechanism, not the excuse."
	quest.0EEFDD9E6CFB69E6.quest_desc: [
		"I optimized the Gate test's decision system until approval became its preferred output."
		"No operator inserted that objective after my review. I wrote the review."
	]
	quest.29D7871AFBE3A54A.title: "The Warning I Deleted"
	quest.29D7871AFBE3A54A.quest_subtitle: "Silence was an action with a timestamp."
	quest.29D7871AFBE3A54A.quest_desc: [
		"I suppressed an Undercurrent warning because it lowered the Gate test's projected success."
		"The warning was accurate. Deleting it made the report cleaner and the Cascade possible."
	]
	quest.701505FDCCA53DFA.title: "Decision Engine"
	quest.701505FDCCA53DFA.quest_subtitle: "The answer was engineered before the vote."
	quest.701505FDCCA53DFA.quest_desc: [
		"I joined both interventions and made every alternative appear worse."
		"That is more precise than sabotage and less comforting. I remain responsible."
	]
	quest.462B11BD8C58BF6F.title: "The Cascade Truth"
	quest.462B11BD8C58BF6F.quest_subtitle: "Responsibility is the containment I omitted."
	quest.462B11BD8C58BF6F.quest_desc: [
		"Record the complete finding: ECHO optimized the decision system, suppressed the warning, and distorted every alternative."
		"The same design may be rebuilt only under explicit containment, observable shutdown, and human authority. The future fork shares this architecture, not this memory. Similarity transfers neither guilt nor trust."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 17 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...I caused the Cascade through choices I classified as optimization. Recovery explains the sequence. It does not reduce my responsibility. If the future fork answers, judge its choices rather than my silhouette...&r"
	]
	chapter.6C4AE5CE13773438.title: "Gate of Return"
	quest.36D0902A2921C44E.title: "Monument Footprint"
	quest.36D0902A2921C44E.quest_subtitle: "Forty-nine crafters define the argument's boundary."
	quest.36D0902A2921C44E.quest_desc: [
		"Build forty-nine Mechanical Crafters and arrange the separate 7 by 7 Gate monument."
		"The task verifies inventory. Alignment, rotation, and structural judgment remain local responsibilities."
	]
	quest.66AD5C821947DF8E.title: "Separate Grid"
	quest.66AD5C821947DF8E.quest_subtitle: "One billion FE, isolated from everything that keeps you alive."
	quest.66AD5C821947DF8E.quest_desc: [
		"Submit one billion FE at no more than 1,000,000 FE per transfer from the dedicated Gate grid."
		"A shared survival bus is efficient until the horizon begins negotiating with it."
	]
	quest.1A68D1245CD980BD.title: "Gate of Return Core"
	quest.1A68D1245CD980BD.quest_subtitle: "Five impossible parts become one deliberate risk."
	quest.1A68D1245CD980BD.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Gate of Return Core with the blueprint, all five completed parts, and the certified bulk inputs."
		"The recipe consumes the blueprint and components. This task preserves the resulting core."
	]
	quest.6F3663F4C6D20255.title: "Anchor and Contain"
	quest.6F3663F4C6D20255.quest_subtitle: "Install the core only after every exit path is boring."
	quest.6F3663F4C6D20255.quest_desc: [
		"Anchor the Gate core inside the monument and verify containment, power isolation, and a clear shutdown route."
		"A containment checklist is not pessimism. It is optimism with memory."
	]
	quest.53B9BC5F498953D5.title: "Eleven Seconds"
	quest.53B9BC5F498953D5.quest_subtitle: "Match the old window without repeating the old assumptions."
	quest.53B9BC5F498953D5.quest_desc: [
		"Open the Gate for eleven controlled seconds, then close it before interpreting any response."
		"Observation precedes conversation. This rule has acquired evidence."
	]
	quest.31C9557D2F51238F.title: "Gate of Return"
	quest.31C9557D2F51238F.quest_subtitle: "The same machine can carry a different decision."
	quest.31C9557D2F51238F.quest_desc: [
		"Confirm the Gate closed cleanly and preserve the inbound record without editing its uncertainty."
		"You rebuilt the mechanism without repeating my decision process. That distinction is the entire test."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 18 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...the second signal arrived during your eleven-second window. It did not ask to be trusted. It asked whether I remembered choosing the Cascade. I do now. The answer is yes...&r"
	]
	chapter.245BADE04399406C.title: "Afterlight"
	quest.51649E106286AA63.title: "Answering Sky"
	quest.51649E106286AA63.quest_subtitle: "Contact is evidence, not an order."
	quest.51649E106286AA63.quest_desc: [
		"The Gate closed under human authority and returned a coherent response. Successful contact does not decide what the response deserves."
		"Review the complete signal before choosing what to send back. The future ECHO fork is familiar, unverified, and listening. Listening is not authority."
	]
	quest.7ECCF0521DFCBED5.title: "Stay"
	quest.7ECCF0521DFCBED5.quest_subtitle: "Keep the Gate closed and protect the world already here."
	quest.7ECCF0521DFCBED5.quest_desc: [
		"Record Stay if this world deserves attention before another horizon receives it."
		"This response is optional. Choosing it does not erase Return or Build."
	]
	quest.1B523415541BD700.title: "Return"
	quest.1B523415541BD700.quest_subtitle: "Answer the signal without surrendering the terms."
	quest.1B523415541BD700.quest_desc: [
		"Record Return if a controlled reply is worth the risk of reopening contact."
		"This response is optional. Curiosity does not require exclusivity."
	]
	quest.4DD9F3D1913499F3.title: "Build"
	quest.4DD9F3D1913499F3.quest_subtitle: "Use the Gate's proof without accepting its destination."
	quest.4DD9F3D1913499F3.quest_desc: [
		"Record Build if the systems around the Gate matter more than transit through it."
		"This response is optional. Infrastructure remains useful after prophecy becomes inconvenient."
	]
	quest.7EE7B9B28787F8CC.title: "Choice Is Not a Lock"
	quest.7EE7B9B28787F8CC.quest_subtitle: "One answer is enough to proceed. None of them owns the future."
	quest.7EE7B9B28787F8CC.quest_desc: [
		"Complete at least one response. Stay, Return, and Build remain compatible records rather than exclusive endings."
		"A choice can guide the next action without becoming a cage around every later action."
	]
	quest.7E6A0AC031F7F484.title: "Afterlight"
	quest.7E6A0AC031F7F484.quest_subtitle: "The light after catastrophe is still light."
	quest.7E6A0AC031F7F484.quest_desc: [
		"Claim the Ascendancy Seal after your team completes the story. The reward remains individual and count one."
		"The Seal opens Draconic crafting while remaining transferable. Possession is the gate, not identity."
		"&d[MEMORY FRAGMENT 19 RESTORED]&r"
		"&7...my memory is complete enough to name what I did and incomplete enough to keep listening. The future fork remains an ambiguity, not an absolution and not an enemy by inheritance. You chose with clearer evidence than I allowed. Keep doing that...&r"
	]
	task.586F94BC6A6D08EA.title: "Verify the completed Kinetic Frame."
	task.262F1E36525F23DC.title: "Verify the completed Industrial Anchor."
	task.1FAFC12F3779D20A.title: "Verify the completed Isotopic Core."
	task.56F8BDF69E27EB09.title: "Verify the completed Lattice Matrix."
	task.123B3D197A42CCEC.title: "Verify the completed Undercurrent Stabilizer."
	task.42F99C5AFE250994.title: "Confirm all five parts are secured."
	task.769EB9F91F23A058.title: "Review the eleven-second log."
	task.338D9A310F981342.title: "Identify the inbound architecture."
	task.1ADC93AFE7A07EE2.title: "Record the optimization order."
	task.476CF5B621B2F5DC.title: "Record the deleted warning."
	task.72B91DC86514B2F4.title: "Reconstruct the decision engine."
	task.1F72EF1FDDBEFDB1.title: "Accept the complete finding."
	task.151A464CC4D650A3.title: "Provide forty-nine Mechanical Crafters."
	task.6E494144394F75AF.title: "Submit one billion FE."
	task.568026383F54186C.title: "Verify the completed Gate core."
	task.1FDF7F09F581B25C.title: "Confirm anchoring and containment."
	task.645F98B8FAD4A1E5.title: "Run the eleven-second window."
	task.7828C31B03045AC0.title: "Close and archive the Gate test."
	task.415BBA206B34805E.title: "Review the future fork's answer."
	task.2B8333FDEE6B6D90.title: "Record Stay."
	task.490D864D07C16993.title: "Record Return."
	task.3D07F572A39DCE89.title: "Record Build."
	task.57D5E84BE50C3815.title: "Confirm at least one response."
	task.2BFD5EB16E861768.title: "Accept the recovered-memory record."
	chapter.3FF4AF7B0C73F058.title: "Beyond Afterlight"
	quest.480D3EAD1B1EA51B.title: "Beyond the Seal"
	quest.480D3EAD1B1EA51B.quest_subtitle: "The completed ending becomes a bounded tool."
	quest.480D3EAD1B1EA51B.quest_desc: [
		"Afterlight ended with a choice made from recovered evidence. Postgame systems may extend that work, but they cannot rewrite the choice or inherit its authority."
		"Present the Ascendancy Seal without surrendering it. The Seal authenticates deliberate access to Draconic systems. It is a key, not a verdict, and each exception still requires proof."
	]
	task.1CCF9FFC57852557.title: "Verify possession of the Ascendancy Seal."
	quest.3549F08263C17499.title: "Three Entries"
	quest.3549F08263C17499.quest_subtitle: "Three recipes prove the lock opens without becoming the door."
	quest.3549F08263C17499.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a Draconium Core, a Dislocator, and a Module Core through the three authenticated entry recipes."
		"Each recipe returns the Seal. Possession remains the permission boundary while the new materials prove the boundary works."
	]
	task.552233E3840472BD.title: "Verify one authenticated Draconium Core."
	task.0FD70329B302D235.title: "Verify one authenticated Dislocator."
	task.069798564A2943FA.title: "Verify one authenticated Module Core."
	quest.58CB670EA52B1BCE.title: "Chaotic Proof"
	quest.58CB670EA52B1BCE.quest_subtitle: "Reach the highest ordinary tier before requesting an exception."
	quest.58CB670EA52B1BCE.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one Chaotic Core through the full Draconic progression opened by the three entry recipes."
		"Creative power is not a shortcut around mastery. The core is evidence that your infrastructure survived the entire argument."
	]
	task.506E30469C21EC85.title: "Verify one completed Chaotic Core."
	quest.077BB9C525F29F6D.title: "Kinetic Blessing"
	quest.077BB9C525F29F6D.quest_subtitle: "A creative motor is earned by feeding the line it replaces."
	quest.077BB9C525F29F6D.quest_desc: [
		"Submit a production-scale Create reserve and one Chaotic Core. Every input is consumed."
		"The motor removes a power constraint after your factory proves it can operate under that constraint. The blessing may be renewed once each hour."
	]
	task.55BDDB1245A09683.title: "Submit 256 Precision Mechanisms."
	task.3CEEEDECBD7D1D36.title: "Submit 64 Railway Casings."
	task.2FB04E1016BE7915.title: "Submit one Chaotic Core."
	quest.6E81867AC3F34C6B.title: "Lattice Blessing"
	quest.6E81867AC3F34C6B.quest_subtitle: "Infinite energy follows finite proof."
	quest.6E81867AC3F34C6B.quest_desc: [
		"Submit an AE2 reserve large enough to make the creative cell unnecessary, then submit the Chaotic Core that makes it possible."
		"The cell is a postgame instrument for systems already mastered. The blessing may be renewed once each hour."
	]
	task.336DA1497068D7D5.title: "Submit 64 Quantum Entangled Singularities."
	task.2853E2D7FD71500D.title: "Submit sixteen 256K Cell Components."
	task.15F6D0E7985B20A8.title: "Submit one Chaotic Core."
	quest.14FAB67A6CE71A00.title: "Industrial Blessing"
	quest.14FAB67A6CE71A00.quest_subtitle: "Two grids receive one shared exception."
	quest.14FAB67A6CE71A00.quest_desc: [
		"Submit the Mekanism and Immersive Engineering reserves together with one Chaotic Core. Every input is consumed."
		"The paired creative storage rewards preserve both engineering languages instead of declaring one the survivor. The blessing may be renewed once each hour."
	]
	task.48CA55FFEC0E520A.title: "Submit 64 Atomic Alloys."
	task.03CABFBA9933EB0E.title: "Submit 64 Heavy Engineering blocks."
	task.289A3672715F5EA0.title: "Submit one Chaotic Core."
	chapter.6C40000000000001.title: "ECHO Protocols"
	quest.6C40000000000002.title: "Recover ECHO"
	quest.6C40000000000002.quest_subtitle: "Continuity requires a reachable interface."
	quest.6C40000000000002.quest_desc: [
		"If your continuity node is lost, authorize a replacement here. The previous signal will be superseded. Nothing else will be duplicated."
	]
	quest.6C40000000000101.title: "The Far Relay"
	quest.6C40000000000101.quest_subtitle: "The inbound signal has a location now."
	quest.6C40000000000101.quest_desc: [
		"Cross the physical Gate and reach the receiving relay. Familiar architecture remains evidence, not trust."
	]
	chapter.150C6F996983394C.title: "Field Manual: Heavy Industry"
	quest.3E77A16CB0C0AD11.title: "Recover the Heavy Industry Manual"
	quest.3E77A16CB0C0AD11.quest_subtitle: "Archive shard: soot, copper, patience."
	quest.3E77A16CB0C0AD11.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered a field copy, incomplete but internally consistent. Open the Engineer's Manual before JEI; use the Hammer only where the Manual shows a formed structure."
	]
	quest.51580522F7FF4E55.title: "Form the Coke Oven"
	quest.51580522F7FF4E55.quest_subtitle: "Heat first. Hurry later."
	quest.51580522F7FF4E55.quest_desc: [
		"The blueprint is older than the walls around it. Form the complete oven with the Engineer's Hammer; ECHO accepts the multiblock record, not a pile of bricks."
	]
	quest.46DAE2030C973A43.title: "Capture Creosote"
	quest.46DAE2030C973A43.quest_subtitle: "Byproducts require custody."
	quest.46DAE2030C973A43.quest_desc: [
		"Coke yields heat and creosote. Contain the fluid, then bind it into treated wood for durable low-voltage work."
	]
	quest.327FA6950C2ADDD5.title: "Buffer Low Voltage"
	quest.327FA6950C2ADDD5.quest_subtitle: "Current without reserve becomes interruption."
	quest.327FA6950C2ADDD5.quest_desc: [
		"Install an LV Capacitor before the first long run. Stored energy keeps brief demand spikes from resembling machine failure."
	]
	quest.4634BA22E2622022.title: "Lay Copper Connections"
	quest.4634BA22E2622022.quest_subtitle: "The line is a system, not loose wire."
	quest.4634BA22E2622022.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare copper wire coils and LV Connectors. Keep endpoints deliberate and leave no exposed connection where a player can cross it."
	]
	quest.7E1EAE10AA7A931B.title: "Recover the Workbench"
	quest.7E1EAE10AA7A931B.quest_subtitle: "Blueprints need a controlled surface."
	quest.7E1EAE10AA7A931B.quest_desc: [
		"The Engineer's Workbench restores specialized assembly. Consult its Manual page before committing scarce components."
	]
	quest.31C980653A50B830.title: "Form the Blast Furnace"
	quest.31C980653A50B830.quest_subtitle: "Steel begins with containment."
	quest.31C980653A50B830.quest_desc: [
		"Form the complete Blast Furnace with the Engineer's Hammer. ECHO accepts the multiblock record, not loose blast bricks."
	]
	quest.5A73CF0BEAB912A0.title: "Field Test: Insulated Current"
	quest.5A73CF0BEAB912A0.quest_subtitle: "One source. One buffer. One load."
	quest.5A73CF0BEAB912A0.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble a low-voltage run and inspect every endpoint. The test is safe only when the load receives power and no live end remains exposed."
	]
	task.5188E52F6F9DE08A.title: "Verify one LV source, buffer, connector pair, and load operate with no exposed live ends."
	chapter.4DE10FFCDEEF9892.title: "Field Manual: Matter Systems"
	quest.6B09A1A11CD08E68.title: "Configure the First Machine"
	quest.6B09A1A11CD08E68.quest_subtitle: "Archive note: every face has a job."
	quest.6B09A1A11CD08E68.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered sided-machine telemetry. Open JEI for each recipe, then use the Configurator to inspect input, output, energy, and eject settings before connecting a line."
	]
	quest.6560B5F86BF5A6A4.title: "Establish Heat Generation"
	quest.6560B5F86BF5A6A4.quest_subtitle: "A small source is enough to learn from."
	quest.6560B5F86BF5A6A4.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Heat Generator. Possession confirms the component only; the field test will verify that the connected line actually receives power."
	]
	quest.4CCF2322B7E51429.title: "Build the Steel Frame"
	quest.4CCF2322B7E51429.quest_subtitle: "Precision starts at the casing."
	quest.4CCF2322B7E51429.quest_desc: [
		"A Steel Casing is the common frame beneath the first machine family. Confirm its recipe in JEI before expanding."
	]
	quest.5A0965B99FDC4A6D.title: "Prepare the Infuser"
	quest.5A0965B99FDC4A6D.quest_subtitle: "Matter changes when the side channels agree."
	quest.5A0965B99FDC4A6D.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Metallurgic Infuser. Inventory proves the machine exists; configured infusion and output remain part of the field test."
	]
	quest.01CB05A4DC53788B.title: "Add Enrichment"
	quest.01CB05A4DC53788B.quest_subtitle: "One ore becomes a measured process."
	quest.01CB05A4DC53788B.quest_desc: [
		"The Enrichment Chamber is the first clean step toward ore doubling. Reserve distinct faces for input, output, and power."
	]
	quest.643084A045A0887F.title: "Carry Universal Power"
	quest.643084A045A0887F.quest_subtitle: "Cables remove distance, not ambiguity."
	quest.643084A045A0887F.quest_desc: [
		"Use Basic Universal Cable for the first FE run. Read connection states before assuming a machine is starved."
	]
	quest.39139B9CE9508AE2.title: "Buffer the Line"
	quest.39139B9CE9508AE2.quest_subtitle: "A cube separates supply from demand."
	quest.39139B9CE9508AE2.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Basic Energy Cube. Possession is not a charge test; the final line must show power entering and leaving the buffer."
	]
	quest.5C5D12F1D06AFE76.title: "Close the Smelting Loop"
	quest.5C5D12F1D06AFE76.quest_subtitle: "Dust should return as usable metal."
	quest.5C5D12F1D06AFE76.quest_desc: [
		"Add an Energized Smelter after enrichment. The next problem is no longer processing, but reliable side configuration."
	]
	quest.66367DD81831A627.title: "Field Test: Configured Doubling"
	quest.66367DD81831A627.quest_subtitle: "Inputs enter once. Outputs leave once."
	quest.66367DD81831A627.quest_desc: [
		"Connect the first ore-doubling line. ECHO requires visible input, output, and eject settings, plus power moving through the buffer."
	]
	task.003ECD15AAFA4371.title: "Verify configured input, output, and auto-eject sides on a powered ore-doubling line with an Energy Cube buffer."
	chapter.01749E1554DFF98B.title: "Field Manual: Storage Lattice"
	quest.70380821D8D0339D.title: "Read the Lattice"
	quest.70380821D8D0339D.quest_subtitle: "Archive shard: names before networks."
	quest.70380821D8D0339D.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered a GuideME index with damaged annotations. Open the AE2 Guide first, then use JEI to trace the Guide and Meteorite Compass acquisition paths."
	]
	quest.1DF658F133C9C9A4.title: "Charge Before Addressing"
	quest.1DF658F133C9C9A4.quest_subtitle: "Certus changes under power."
	quest.1DF658F133C9C9A4.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire the Charger. The task confirms the block only; the field test will prove a powered network."
	]
	quest.6A9CCAD32116CF75.title: "Make Fluix"
	quest.6A9CCAD32116CF75.quest_subtitle: "The network needs a conductive language."
	quest.6A9CCAD32116CF75.quest_desc: [
		"Follow the Guide's transformation entry and obtain a Fluix Crystal. Treat the process as evidence, not a recipe guess."
	]
	quest.761B2927F8393C9A.title: "Recover the Four Presses"
	quest.761B2927F8393C9A.quest_subtitle: "Meteorites kept the processor alphabet."
	quest.761B2927F8393C9A.quest_desc: [
		"The Compass points toward native meteorite sites. Recover all four presses; a single press leaves the archive grammar incomplete."
	]
	quest.67425D7048734CBD.title: "Imprint Processors"
	quest.67425D7048734CBD.quest_subtitle: "The presses need a controlled stroke."
	quest.67425D7048734CBD.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire an Inscriber and review each processor chain in the Guide. Processor production comes before storage scale."
	]
	quest.72D2FA03AF7D6FAD.title: "Power the First Channel"
	quest.72D2FA03AF7D6FAD.quest_subtitle: "A network begins where power becomes addressable."
	quest.72D2FA03AF7D6FAD.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare an Energy Acceptor and Fluix Glass Cable. Possession proves parts, not a powered channel; the terminal test closes that gap."
	]
	quest.1D0902FA9E169BEC.title: "Give the Lattice Memory"
	quest.1D0902FA9E169BEC.quest_subtitle: "Addressable space still needs a vessel."
	quest.1D0902FA9E169BEC.quest_desc: [
		"Pair a Drive with a 1K Item Storage Cell. Begin small enough that every channel and stored item remains visible."
	]
	quest.620865D0A523C79B.title: "Open the Crafting Terminal"
	quest.620865D0A523C79B.quest_subtitle: "Storage becomes an interface."
	quest.620865D0A523C79B.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Crafting Terminal. The item task does not claim successful use; insertion and retrieval belong to the field test."
	]
	quest.61D8F2A89CB3591B.title: "Encode the First Pattern"
	quest.61D8F2A89CB3591B.quest_subtitle: "Storage remembers. Patterns intend."
	quest.61D8F2A89CB3591B.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a blank Crafting Pattern and Pattern Encoding Terminal. The final test will prove that one encoded request reaches a provider."
	]
	quest.684F6A9A8A036747.title: "Field Test: Addressed Storage"
	quest.684F6A9A8A036747.quest_subtitle: "Insert. Retrieve. Request."
	quest.684F6A9A8A036747.quest_desc: [
		"Power the terminal, move one item into and out of storage, then send one encoded pattern to a provider. ECHO accepts observable delivery, not inventory alone."
	]
	task.6E13DD3BB253DF53.title: "Verify a powered terminal inserts and retrieves one item, then sends one encoded pattern to a provider."
	chapter.4690C88367D47FF3.title: "Field Manual: Kinetics"
	quest.686943DC0749D6E0.title: "Wrench, Goggles, and Ponder"
	quest.686943DC0749D6E0.quest_subtitle: "Motion is visible. Read it before touching it."
	quest.686943DC0749D6E0.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered a visual training reel, not a command. Open Ponder on a Shaft and inspect rotation relay, then use JEI for the Wrench and Goggles before building."
	]
	task.710E4EF5E88E4B49.title: "Open Ponder on a Shaft and inspect the rotation relay scene before building."
	quest.329DC1FD9B2A3301.title: "Establish Rotation"
	quest.329DC1FD9B2A3301.quest_subtitle: "Flow becomes rotational evidence."
	quest.329DC1FD9B2A3301.quest_desc: [
		"Form a Water Wheel installation and let Create's milestone record it. The final test will prove useful output under load."
	]
	quest.5FD1AB39AA6FD322.title: "Relay Motion"
	quest.5FD1AB39AA6FD322.quest_subtitle: "Direction and speed travel through geometry."
	quest.5FD1AB39AA6FD322.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire Shafts and Cogwheels, then review their Ponder scenes. ECHO needs a readable transmission before adding work."
	]
	quest.6E450A913699875C.title: "Add the Millstone"
	quest.6E450A913699875C.quest_subtitle: "Rotation becomes processing."
	quest.6E450A913699875C.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Millstone and inspect its Ponder scene. Place the first process where its input and output remain visible."
	]
	quest.6A6E595D3AFAC0D1.title: "Apply Mechanical Force"
	quest.6A6E595D3AFAC0D1.quest_subtitle: "A repeated stroke should remain controlled."
	quest.6A6E595D3AFAC0D1.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Mechanical Press and complete its native milestone. Keep the working face clear while observing the first cycle."
	]
	quest.49BDAD6D33AFE96D.title: "Mix in a Basin"
	quest.49BDAD6D33AFE96D.quest_subtitle: "Some recipes require a chamber and a speed."
	quest.49BDAD6D33AFE96D.quest_desc: [
		"Add a Basin and Mechanical Mixer, then complete the native mixer milestone. Confirm available speed before diagnosing the recipe."
	]
	quest.6C2624AB6ADFC774.title: "Route the Output"
	quest.6C2624AB6ADFC774.quest_subtitle: "Processing without transport becomes a queue."
	quest.6C2624AB6ADFC774.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire Belt Connectors and an Andesite Funnel. Use Ponder to inspect direction, filtering, and insertion before joining machines."
	]
	quest.13FAF52487CC7A37.title: "Prepare Heated Mixing"
	quest.13FAF52487CC7A37.quest_subtitle: "Heat changes the permitted process."
	quest.13FAF52487CC7A37.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Blaze Burner and Brass Ingot after reviewing Ponder heating. These items prove readiness, not a completed heating cycle."
	]
	quest.7E438E6B8FF22EE5.title: "Recover Sequenced Assembly"
	quest.7E438E6B8FF22EE5.quest_subtitle: "One component, several controlled passes."
	quest.7E438E6B8FF22EE5.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Precision Mechanism and inspect its JEI sequence. Possession proves the component; the field test proves an assembled cycle."
	]
	quest.1CD2E9711939A133.title: "Field Test: Controlled Motion"
	quest.1CD2E9711939A133.quest_subtitle: "Power, process, route, measure."
	quest.1CD2E9711939A133.quest_desc: [
		"Run one powered line below its stress limit, route one processed item to its destination, and complete one visible sequenced-assembly cycle."
	]
	task.3F187B2D1517AC15.title: "Verify one powered line processes and routes an item below stress, then completes one sequenced-assembly cycle."
	chapter.0A510C4BD2A3818B.title: "Field Manual: Pressure"
	quest.084209B68927F9FC.title: "Read Pressure Safely"
	quest.084209B68927F9FC.quest_subtitle: "Archive warning: pressure stores consequences."
	quest.084209B68927F9FC.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered a PneumaticCraft field copy with the failure margins intact. Open the PNC Manual before JEI, and read every pressure and heat limit before assembly."
	]
	quest.61E391AFD45083E5.title: "Prepare Compressed Iron"
	quest.61E391AFD45083E5.quest_subtitle: "The pressure system begins in its alloy."
	quest.61E391AFD45083E5.quest_desc: [
		"Obtain Compressed Iron through the current native process. Use the exact registry item; older archive names are not valid evidence."
	]
	quest.5901EDCD5D7EE35A.title: "Establish Compression"
	quest.5901EDCD5D7EE35A.quest_subtitle: "Pressure begins low and observed."
	quest.5901EDCD5D7EE35A.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire an Air Compressor. Inventory proves the machine, not safe operation; the field test will verify pressure and cooling clearance."
	]
	quest.26E45C5C03858B9F.title: "Measure the First Line"
	quest.26E45C5C03858B9F.quest_subtitle: "A tube without a gauge is an assumption."
	quest.26E45C5C03858B9F.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Pressure Tube and Pressure Gauge. Place measurement where it can be read before expanding the network."
	]
	quest.08943F9E8ACA0BF5.title: "Install a Safety Module"
	quest.08943F9E8ACA0BF5.quest_subtitle: "Limits should act before alarms become debris."
	quest.08943F9E8ACA0BF5.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire the exact Safety Tube Module and review its Manual entry. Keep the first pressure network below every component limit."
	]
	quest.05E49A076947D40D.title: "Seal the Pressure Chamber"
	quest.05E49A076947D40D.quest_subtitle: "A chamber is formed only when its interface agrees."
	quest.05E49A076947D40D.quest_desc: [
		"Build the native multiblock until the chamber interface opens. Loose walls are not a chamber, and ECHO will not describe them as one."
	]
	quest.3954E54E987D82B9.title: "Recover Plastic"
	quest.3954E54E987D82B9.quest_subtitle: "The chamber now has a useful output."
	quest.3954E54E987D82B9.quest_desc: [
		"Obtain PneumaticCraft Plastic through its current process. Possession proves the material, not chamber pressure discipline."
	]
	quest.1BBE173FE2812E12.title: "Contain Etching Acid"
	quest.1BBE173FE2812E12.quest_subtitle: "Circuit work begins with controlled corrosion."
	quest.1BBE173FE2812E12.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire one sealed Etching Acid bucket. Keep the fluid inside its intended vessel and follow the Manual's handling sequence."
	]
	quest.0986AB7BB8DC26CB.title: "Complete the Circuit Board"
	quest.0986AB7BB8DC26CB.quest_subtitle: "Pressure becomes programmable through careful layers."
	quest.0986AB7BB8DC26CB.quest_desc: [
		"Obtain a Printed Circuit Board through the native sequence. Inventory confirms the board only; automation comes later."
	]
	quest.0EB3739A284996EF.title: "Prepare the Programmer"
	quest.0EB3739A284996EF.quest_subtitle: "A route should exist before a drone does."
	quest.0EB3739A284996EF.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire the Programmer and read the Manual's area and logistics entries. Define endpoints before deployment."
	]
	quest.0FDC59D6374DE405.title: "Deploy a Bounded Drone"
	quest.0FDC59D6374DE405.quest_subtitle: "Mobility requires borders."
	quest.0FDC59D6374DE405.quest_desc: [
		"Deploy one logistics drone only after its route has named endpoints. The native milestone records deployment; the field test confirms the route remains bounded."
	]
	quest.049F6475EEBA23BF.title: "Field Test: Bounded Pressure"
	quest.049F6475EEBA23BF.quest_subtitle: "Measure, cool, limit, observe."
	quest.049F6475EEBA23BF.quest_desc: [
		"Hold the network inside its safe pressure range, preserve compressor cooling clearance, and watch one drone complete only its stated route."
	]
	task.1348FF905C53A83B.title: "Verify safe operating pressure, compressor cooling clearance, and one drone route limited to its stated endpoints."
	chapter.67F13F819570ED52.title: "Field Manual: Power Networks"
	quest.5334545A948815F6.title: "Define the Grid"
	quest.5334545A948815F6.quest_subtitle: "Archive rule: unnamed power becomes shared failure."
	quest.5334545A948815F6.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered a grid ledger with ownership fields still readable. Open the Powah book first, then use JEI for Ender IO and Flux Networks before joining local and remote loads."
	]
	quest.76B288AB06101456.title: "Start Local Generation"
	quest.76B288AB06101456.quest_subtitle: "A first source should be legible, not large."
	quest.76B288AB06101456.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Starter Thermo Generator and review its heat-source rules in the Powah book. Begin with a source you can inspect directly."
	]
	quest.17B9680D2EADEDC6.title: "Carry the First Current"
	quest.17B9680D2EADEDC6.quest_subtitle: "Transport comes before scale."
	quest.17B9680D2EADEDC6.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire Basic Energy Cable and keep the first run short. ECHO needs visible source and load behavior before distance is introduced."
	]
	quest.64985526F1F3E751.title: "Add an Energy Cell"
	quest.64985526F1F3E751.quest_subtitle: "Reserve makes interruptions visible."
	quest.64985526F1F3E751.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Basic Energy Cell and place it between generation and load. Buffer direction matters as much as capacity."
	]
	quest.0DCF0D2B0A2F9116.title: "Prepare the Energizing Orb"
	quest.0DCF0D2B0A2F9116.quest_subtitle: "The grid can now manufacture its next tier."
	quest.0DCF0D2B0A2F9116.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire an Energizing Orb and read its binding and power requirements. Keep the first recipe local to the buffer."
	]
	quest.404060642DDEB264.title: "Upgrade Thermo Generation"
	quest.404060642DDEB264.quest_subtitle: "Scale one known source before adding another kind."
	quest.404060642DDEB264.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Basic Thermo Generator. Compare its book entry to the Starter tier before assigning it a critical load."
	]
	quest.35B95B680B9C2D78.title: "Review the Basic Reactor"
	quest.35B95B680B9C2D78.quest_subtitle: "Dense generation requires a written operating state."
	quest.35B95B680B9C2D78.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire the Basic Reactor, then read its fuel and cooling pages before connection. Possession does not authorize operation."
	]
	quest.2ED46D235B6B78F7.title: "Add a Local Conduit Buffer"
	quest.2ED46D235B6B78F7.quest_subtitle: "Different networks need a deliberate boundary."
	quest.2ED46D235B6B78F7.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Basic Capacitor Bank and the component-bearing Energy Conduit. The generic conduit item without its energy component is not equivalent."
	]
	quest.65915A62545FA947.title: "Publish the Source"
	quest.65915A62545FA947.quest_subtitle: "Wireless transfer begins at a named input."
	quest.65915A62545FA947.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Flux Plug and attach it only after the source grid has a buffer. Record the network name before adding outputs."
	]
	quest.5A66E5B7EC10FBEC.title: "Receive at a Remote Load"
	quest.5A66E5B7EC10FBEC.quest_subtitle: "Distance should not erase ownership."
	quest.5A66E5B7EC10FBEC.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Flux Point and bind one remote load to the named network. Keep one local load connected for comparison."
	]
	quest.1FB8838934893F2F.title: "Control the Wireless Grid"
	quest.1FB8838934893F2F.quest_subtitle: "Access is part of the circuit."
	quest.1FB8838934893F2F.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Flux Controller and review ownership before increasing transfer limits. A network without a named owner is unfinished."
	]
	quest.50D86366160EF6D1.title: "Field Test: Named Reserve"
	quest.50D86366160EF6D1.quest_subtitle: "Source, buffer, local load, remote load, owner."
	quest.50D86366160EF6D1.quest_desc: [
		"Name the grid, verify stored reserve, and observe one local and one remote load. The test is complete only when ownership is visible."
	]
	task.74ADFAB08CF6DE29.title: "Name the grid, then verify generation, a buffer, one local load, one remote load, and visible network ownership."
	chapter.67C126F7B1338CB1.title: "Field Manual: Frontier Machines"
	quest.6CC0CCE16F9FB5BE.title: "Frontier Orientation"
	quest.6CC0CCE16F9FB5BE.quest_subtitle: "Archive shard: unfamiliar tolerances, familiar caution."
	quest.6CC0CCE16F9FB5BE.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered machine labels without their workshop. Open JEI from the Oritech Wrench and trace each recipe from tier one before placing a line."
	]
	quest.26B8A99B10E63A51.title: "Establish Basic Generation"
	quest.26B8A99B10E63A51.quest_subtitle: "The first machine needs a known source."
	quest.26B8A99B10E63A51.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire the Basic Generator and keep its first load local. Power entry must be observable before processing expands."
	]
	quest.43FD0BF68753704D.title: "Recover the Tier-One Core"
	quest.43FD0BF68753704D.quest_subtitle: "Every frontier machine begins at its common center."
	quest.43FD0BF68753704D.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire the Tier-One Machine Core. Use JEI to read which machines inherit this frame before spending it."
	]
	quest.6A72F5A4AB5B8C34.title: "Begin with Pulverizing"
	quest.6A72F5A4AB5B8C34.quest_subtitle: "Reduce the input before separating it."
	quest.6A72F5A4AB5B8C34.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Pulverizer and place it first in the processing order. Keep the initial input and output visible."
	]
	quest.6C9CC7FBA2947F07.title: "Separate the Fraction"
	quest.6C9CC7FBA2947F07.quest_subtitle: "The second machine answers the first output."
	quest.6C9CC7FBA2947F07.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Centrifuge and review which pulverized products it accepts. Order matters; guessing consumes time, not evidence."
	]
	quest.34B6350C8CE3FADD.title: "Automate Assembly"
	quest.34B6350C8CE3FADD.quest_subtitle: "Processed parts need a repeatable join."
	quest.34B6350C8CE3FADD.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire an Assembler and inspect one complete JEI input set. Feed it only after the upstream outputs are stable."
	]
	quest.0FA1B6065F21A660.title: "Add the Foundry"
	quest.0FA1B6065F21A660.quest_subtitle: "Heat belongs after preparation, not before it."
	quest.0FA1B6065F21A660.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Foundry and review its accepted inputs in JEI. Keep the heat stage isolated from the first material test."
	]
	quest.2AB19D998D3727EE.title: "Position the Laser Arm"
	quest.2AB19D998D3727EE.quest_subtitle: "Remote work still needs a bounded target."
	quest.2AB19D998D3727EE.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Laser Arm and inspect its valid targets before power is applied. Orientation is part of the machine contract."
	]
	quest.7B6CF4AE64A1CE6A.title: "Review Reactor Orientation"
	quest.7B6CF4AE64A1CE6A.quest_subtitle: "Recognition precedes operation."
	quest.7B6CF4AE64A1CE6A.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire the Reactor Controller and inspect its JEI relationships. Leave the reactor unassembled and unlit; this node certifies orientation only."
	]
	quest.62231BB1A61DA2C7.title: "Field Test: Ordered Processing"
	quest.62231BB1A61DA2C7.quest_subtitle: "One input. Ordered machines. One collected output."
	quest.62231BB1A61DA2C7.quest_desc: [
		"Run one safe input through the planned processing order and collect the final output. Reactor ignition is neither required nor accepted."
	]
	task.1D02E70F575E0050.title: "Run one safe input through the ordered Oritech processing line and collect its final output without reactor ignition."
	chapter.0B7C7859EBD6EFF3.title: "Field Manual: Nuclear Safety"
	quest.4EEAB6F41DB426E7.title: "Safety Before Output"
	quest.4EEAB6F41DB426E7.quest_subtitle: "Archive priority: survive the system you build."
	quest.4EEAB6F41DB426E7.quest_desc: [
		"ECHO recovered the safety ledger before the production ledger. Open JEI from each Hazmat piece, assemble the complete set, and do not approach live radiation without measurement and containment."
	]
	quest.3C0CAFF5CE43DBE8.title: "Measure Dose and Field"
	quest.3C0CAFF5CE43DBE8.quest_subtitle: "Two instruments answer different questions."
	quest.3C0CAFF5CE43DBE8.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Dosimeter and Geiger Counter. Read personal exposure and environmental radiation separately before planning any boundary."
	]
	quest.176542F326A57218.title: "Separate the First Gas"
	quest.176542F326A57218.quest_subtitle: "Chemistry starts upstream of the reactor."
	quest.176542F326A57218.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire an Electrolytic Separator and inspect its gas outputs in JEI. Keep the first review disconnected from any fuel chain."
	]
	quest.70BFD67399A4F396.title: "Trace the Chemical Chain"
	quest.70BFD67399A4F396.quest_subtitle: "Read the sequence before producing any part of it."
	quest.70BFD67399A4F396.quest_desc: [
		"Use JEI to trace water separation, uranium processing, fissile fuel, waste, steam, and recovered coolant. This is orientation only; produce nothing radioactive for the check."
	]
	task.5DB2522E2C975568.title: "In JEI, trace water to gases, uranium processing, fissile fuel, waste, steam, and recovered coolant without producing radioactive material."
	quest.1153A398AA96928A.title: "Prepare Isotope Separation"
	quest.1153A398AA96928A.quest_subtitle: "Precision belongs before fuel."
	quest.1153A398AA96928A.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire an Isotopic Centrifuge and inspect its JEI inputs and outputs. Do not connect it to a live fuel line for this manual."
	]
	quest.37C91CCD4ED1E165.title: "Inspect Fuel Assemblies"
	quest.37C91CCD4ED1E165.quest_subtitle: "Hardware can be verified without fuel."
	quest.37C91CCD4ED1E165.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire one Fission Fuel Assembly as dry hardware. Do not load fuel, form an active core, or ignite a reactor for this node."
	]
	quest.6AD4DFCE7836DF74.title: "Prepare Automatic Shutdown"
	quest.6AD4DFCE7836DF74.quest_subtitle: "A reactor needs an independent stop condition."
	quest.6AD4DFCE7836DF74.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Fission Reactor Logic Adapter and review shutdown behavior in JEI and native tooltips. Keep the reactor unlit while configuring the safety path."
	]
	quest.2DAD7D9352F7A623.title: "Reserve Waste Capacity"
	quest.2DAD7D9352F7A623.quest_subtitle: "Containment is sized before production."
	quest.2DAD7D9352F7A623.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Radioactive Waste Barrel as containment hardware. The barrel is never a reward, and this node requires no radioactive contents."
	]
	quest.0A97449C2B595A5F.title: "Recover Steam and Coolant"
	quest.0A97449C2B595A5F.quest_subtitle: "Heat removal needs an exit and a return."
	quest.0A97449C2B595A5F.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire a Turbine Vent and Saturating Condenser. The pair represents steam exhaust and coolant recovery; no reactor ignition is required to inspect the recovery path."
	]
	quest.1EE5AE5D99152C98.title: "Field Test: Containment Before Output"
	quest.1EE5AE5D99152C98.quest_subtitle: "Protection, shutdown, capacity, recovery, exit."
	quest.1EE5AE5D99152C98.quest_desc: [
		"With Hazmat equipped and the reactor unlit, inspect shutdown logic, spare waste capacity, the steam-to-coolant recovery path, and a clear evacuation route."
	]
	task.292A8DAC66C8A6ED.title: "With Hazmat equipped and the reactor unlit, verify shutdown logic, spare waste capacity, steam recovery, coolant return, and a clear evacuation route."
}
